<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- pogoro Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ayu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Ayubu shitakulira muntu yumu yakaweriti na haki yawamshema Ayubu mweni katabikiti nentu ata hangu katendandiri vidoda vya kumtendera Mlungu (Ayubu shipandi 1:22). Kwahera yakamana kuwela shitabu sha Ayubu shilembwa shaka gaa, Ayubu kalikaliti shaka shivuwa handa Abrahamu, toziya kalikaliti kwa vinja miya arubaini. Wasomi waliholandiri kuwera Ayubu kalembiti shitabu mweni, kumbiti mlemba yumonga yakamanikandiri kawoniti mbaka kuwagambira wantu wamonga hadisi ayi ya Ayubu na kuyilemba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Ayubu shitakulira ntabiku. Shetani kajimiritwi kumtabisiya Ayubu toziya yomberi ndo yakawonekaniti kuwera kaweza kumlewelera Ayubu kumguwira Mlungu (Ayubu shipandi 1:12). Seemu nkulu ya shitabu sha Ayubu shitakulira mayoweru ga Ayubu na waganja wakuyi toziya yomberi katabika. Waganja wakuyi waliholiti kuwera Ayubu katenditi vidoda, kumbiti Ayubu kamaniti kuwera yomberi kahera vidoda, paaga Mlungu kayowera na Ayubu, Kumbiti kamgambilitindiri ntambu gaa katabiki hangu. Ayubu pakavimaniti kuwera Mlungu kaweza kutenda shoseri shakashifira na wantu hapeni wavimani makulu gakatenda Mlungu, su Mlungu kamtekelera kayi Ayubu kwa ulunda na wana.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagawera amu Mushitabu sha Ayubu</para>
  <para style="io">Mirandu yakatenditi Ayubu na kutabisiwa nentu kwakuyi yakujegitwi na Shetani gawera mushipandi sha kwanja na sha pili</para>
  <para style="io">Mayowera ga Ayubu na waganja wakuyi toziya ya kutabika kwakuyi ga mushitabu sha tatu mpaka sha selasini na saba.</para>
  <para style="io">Mlungu kayowera na Ayubu shipandi sha selasini na nani mpaka arubaini mstali gwa sita.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuhepelera kwa Ayubu na Mlungu ntambu yakamtekeleriti nentu gamu shipandi sha arubaini mstali gwa saba mpaka kumi na saba shitakulira.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Shetani kankumjera Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Paweriti na muntu yumu muisi ya Usi, yawamshema Ayubu. Muntu ayu kaweriti mheri na muntu yakamguwira Mlungu na yakatendandiri ukontola. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Ayubu kaweriti na wana saba wapalu na wahinga watatu, <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />kaweriti na kondolu elufu saba na ngamia elufu tatu na wang'ombi elufu yimu wa kulimira na punda shidala miya tanu na wantumintumi wavuwa nentu. Yomberi kaweriti mlunda nentu kuliku wantu woseri aku kwagulawa mshenji.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Wana wakuyi walishemiraniti kuliya na kulanda ukaya kwa kila yumu gwawu kwa lishaka lyakuyi, wawashemiriti wadada wawu kuliya na kulanda pamuhera nawu. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />“Kila pawamalira kutenda hangu, Ayubu kimukiti mandawira putiputi na kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa kwa kila mwana yumu gwakuyi toziya kaliholiti pamonga wana wakuyi watenda vidoda na kumkalaziya Mlungu mumiyoyu mwawu.”<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Lishaka limu malaika wa Mlungu wagenditi kuliranguziya palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu na shetani viraa kawera pamuhera nawu. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya Shetani, gulawa koshi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Na Shetani kamwankula Mlungu, ndawa kutyangatyanga na kuzyengetazyengeta pasipanu.<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Shetani, gumwona ntumintumi gwangu Ayubu. Kwahera yumonga yakaweriti gambira yomberi Pasipanu poseri. Yomberi ndo muntu mwaminika, yakamguwira Mlungu na yakalitula gweka na ukontola.<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Shetani kamwankula Mtuwa Mlungu, hashi, Ayubu kakuguwira hera? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Hashi, gwengandiri yagumlolera wega zoseri pamuhera na kaya yakuyi na kila shintu shakawera nashi? Gwenga gumtekelera na lunda yakuyi yongereka muisi. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Kumbiti vinu, gujeri kutola vyoseri vyakaweriti navi. Haguwoni ntambu yakakwigiranga pota kutira!<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Shetani, yina, guweza kutenda shoseri shaguweza kwa lunda yakuyi. Ila nagumshinkula mweni. Su, Shetani kawuka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaguwa kwa wana wa Ayubu na lunda yakuyi kuhalibisiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Lishaka limu wana wapalu na wadala wa Ayubu waweriti wankuliya na kulanda pamuhera munumba mwa kaka gwawu mkulu, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />“Ntumintumi yumu kiziti kwa Ayubu pakatuga na kumgambira, tuweriti twankulima na wang'ombi. Punda na womberi waweriti wankuliya pakwegera panu. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Wantu wa Seba vumu watukangala na kuwatola wankanyama na kuwalaga wantumintumi kwa ligumba. Neni gweka yangu mponeka su kwiza kukugambira.”<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />“Pamberi hakeni malili kutakula, ntumintumi yumonga kasoka, kalonga, lumeta lulawa kumpindi luwalunguziya kondolu na wantumintumi, neni gweka yangu mponeka su kwiza kukugambira.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Pamberi hakeni malili kutakula, “Ntumintumi yumonga kaziti pakatuga na kulonga, wakalidayu walipangiti vipinga vitatu wawakomanga ngamiya, wawatola na kuwalaga wantumintumi waku kwa ligumba! Neni gweka yangu mponeka su niza kukugambira.”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Pamberi hakeni malili kutakula, “Ntumintumi yumonga kiziti pakatuga kalonga, wana waku wapalu na wadala waweriti wankuliya na kulanda divayi ukaya kwa kaka gwawu mkulu, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />vumu liyega livuma kulawa kushiwala. Liyikoma numba ayi kila uwega nayeni iwabomokera wana woseri wahowa, neni gweka yangu mponeka su kwiza kukugambira gwenga.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Shakapanu Ayubu kagoloka na kapapula lihabiti lyakuyi na kumoga viri zyakuyi, kansuntamala pasi na kumguwira Mlungu, <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />“Pakalonga, ndawiti mumtima mwa mawu gwangu pota shintu na hahowi pota shintu, Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti na yomberi kaviwusiya, litawu lyakuyi likwiswi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Mumirandu yoseri ayi Ayubu katendandiri vidoda, pota kulihola kuwera Mlungu kakoseya.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Shetani kankumjera kayi Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Iishaka limonga malaika wa Mlungu wiziti kuliranguziya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Shetani na yomberi kiza pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kamkosiya Shetani, gulawa koshi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Yomberi kamwankula Mtuwa Mlungu, ndawa kutyangatyanga na kuzyengetazyengeta pasipanu.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Shetani, hashi, “Gumumwona ntumintumi gwangu Ayubu? Pasipanu kwahera yakana haki handa yomberi na yakamguwira Mlungu na yakalitula kutali na ukontola. Yomberi mpaka vinu kankali mwaminika, tembera gwenga gung'ambiziya nimtabisiyi pota toziya.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Shetani kamwankula Mlungu, “Mashaka goseri muntu kayilolera nshimba yakuyi su kalopoli ukomu wakuyi. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Kumbiti vinu gujeri kumtenda kwa kumshinkula nshimba yakuyi, nakaka hakakwigiri pota kulififa.”<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Shetani, “Vinu guweza kumtenda shagufira, kumbiti na gumlaga.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Hangu Shetani kawuka palongolu pa Mtuwa Mlungu, kamtenda Ayubu kaweri na vironda vitama vya malipu kwanjira lwayu lwa magulu gakuyi mpaka kumtuyi kwakuyi. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ayubu katola shigayi, kaliyagira nashi na kugenda kulivaga pamalivu. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />“Mdala gwakuyi kamgambira, gwankali gwankulikolera na waminika waku? Gumwigiri Mlungu guhowi.”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />“Ayubu kamwankula mdala gwakuyi, gwenga guyowera handa wadala wazigizigi. Hashi twangi maheri kulawa kwa Mlungu na tulemi kwanka madoda kulawa kwakuyi? Mumirandu yoseri ayi, Ayubu katendandiri vidoda kwa kutakula kwakuyi.”<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waganja watatu wa Ayubu wankumtyangira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Waganja watatu wa Ayubu, Elifazi kulawa Temani na Bilidadi kulawa Shuwa na Sofari kulawa mji gwa Naamati, pawapikaniriti madoda goseri gagampatiti Ayubu. Su, wamuwiti kwa pamuhera wagendi kumlola na kumzyangazyanga. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Pawamwoniti kutali wammanitindiri. Su wanja kubotanga na kulira, wazipapulanga nguwu zawu, wasanga lidiku kuliyera na kumituyi yawu. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Shakapanu walivaga palii pasi pakalikaliti Ayubu kwa mashaka saba, paluwala na pashiru, pota kutakula shisoweru shoseri toziya wamwoniti kamuntabiku nkulu nentu.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumlalamikira Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Pa aga Ayubu katakula na kulipangira lishaka lyakiwukiti.<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Ayubu kalonga hangu, <verse eid="JOB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />Lipangilwi lishaka lirii lya kwiwuka kwa neni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">na pashiru palii papabwelitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">lishaka lya kwingira yinda!<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Lishaka ali liweri luwindu na Mlungu kumpindi nakalilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">pota kulangala nakuliwalira.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Lishaka ali liweri luwindu nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">na mawundi totolu gagibiki lishaka alii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">luwindu la pamihi litiliziyi lishaka ali.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Pashiru palii pagibikirwi na luwindu totolu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">napawalangwa mushaka sha shinja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">pota kuwalangwa mushaka sha mwezi goseri,<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Pashiru palii napawera na mdala gwa kupata yinda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">na nemeru nayipikinika mngati mwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Na wahawi wagapangili mashaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">walipangili lishaka ali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">na waganga yawadaha kumwimusiya njoka songu kalikangali lishaka alii.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Pashiru palii pakakoliti yinda ntondu zyakuyi za mandawira na ziweri luwindu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">na zyeni ziheperi kulangala pota kupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">pota naguwona kulangala pagwanja kulawa mandawira,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />Toziya pashiru palii gutatitindiri mtima gwa mawu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">pota kufifa ntabiku naniziwona.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Ntambu gaa howandiri shaka sha kwiwuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Hashi, howandiri pandawiti mumtima?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Ntambu gaa mawu gwangu kaniwuliti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">ntambu gaa noniti maweri gakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Vinu nfintirwa kwa ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">meweri ng'onja na kwoyera,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />pamuhera na wafalumi na wakolamlima wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">yawaweliti walinyawiriti syayi pahala pawu peni na vinu ndo mahami.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Meweri pamuhera na wakolamlima yawaweriti na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">yawazimemeziyiti numba zawu kwa madini ga feza.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Ntambu gaa nfindirwandiri pasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">gambira mwana yakiwukiti na kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">handa nonu yakawonitindiri kulangala?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Aku yawahowiti wakontola waleka kugaziya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">na aku yawatokiti woyera pota lyoga.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Aku watatilwa wanemelera ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">wapikanirandiri liziwu likalipa lya mgolokera gwa watatilwa.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Walunda na wahushu woseri wa aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">yawaweriti watatilwa walekeziwa kulawa kwa watuwa wawu.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Ntambu gaa kulangala kuwawalira walii yawawera muntabika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">na awa yawahinginika kupananwa ukomu?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Muntu yakafira kuhowa kumbiti kahowandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">kasakula kuhowa kuliku luhanja lwalulififiti.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Muntu gambira ayu kanemelera nentu na hakafyapiliri pakahowa na kufintirwa?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Ntambu gaa nendeleyi kulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">Mlungu kandewelera kulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">wezandiri kulola kwang'enda?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Pakuliya nankulila hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">na mashozi gangu gitika gambira mashi ga lishemba.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Shilii shanishitira shimpata, shantiriti ndo shimpata.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Nahera ponga, pota unyamaliru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">noyerandiri, ntabiku zyangu zipelandiri.<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi kakwanja kutakula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1-14:22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Shakapanu Elifazi muntu gwa kulawa Temani kamgambira Ayubu. <verse eid="JOB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Hashi muntu pakafira kuyowera na gwenga hagukalali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Kumbiti gaa yakaweza kulilewelera kutakula?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Guliholi! Gwenga guwafunda wantu wavuwa na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">kuwatanga wanyongi waweri na makakala.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Visoweru vyaku viwagolosiya yawatwezikiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">guwatanga wantu awa walikali ntambu yayifiruwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Kumbiti vinu aga gakupata gwenga na gwenga guwuya kumberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">gakushinkula na gwenga gutila.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Hashi, kumguwira Mlungu ndo litumbiru lyakundiri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">Na haki yaku, ndo litumbiru lyakundiri?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Guliholi vinu. Gaa yakahera likosa yakaweza kwaagamira?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Ama yawahera vidoda walaguwa?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Ntambu yanivimana neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">yawayala ukontola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">na udoda wabenanga galaaga,<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Mlungu kawalaga awa kwa pumula yakuyi na kuwalaga kwa maya gakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Wakontola waguguma gambira simba kakalipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">kumbiti menu gawu gamegangwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Simba yakawera na makakala kafuwa kwa kukosa mawinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">na wana woseri wa simba mdala wapalasiwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Lishaka limu, ng'ambiritwi shisoweru kwa bada,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">naneni mpikaniliti kuninitila kwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Paweriti mmaholu ga pashiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">shaka ashi mbota paziwakola wantu.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Weriti na lyoga nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">ata wera nankulendemela.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Upepu umputa pa sheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">viri za nshimba yangu ziligolosiya.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Shintu shigoloka jii kulongolu kwaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">panishiloliti nishimanitindiri nakamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">Kuweriti na mwoneku tunga kulongolu kwa neni, kuweliti jiii, shakapanu mpikaniriti liziwu.<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />Muntu kaweza kuwera mwaminika kuliku Mlungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Muntu kaweza kuwera kaherepa kuliku muwumba gwakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Handa Mlungu kawawona malaika wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">ata malaika wakuyi wa kumpindi kuwawona wana likosa,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />ndo mala ninga nentu ya walii yawalikala munumba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">za litapaka lya ukaka lyeni lyanjiru lyakuyi lya mumadikudiku, weni waposholwaposholwa gambira wampekenyi!<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Mandawila tuwela wakomu na shaka sha pamihi pashiza kumbiti pota wantu kuviman tuweza kuhowa pamihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">kwahera muntu yakaweza kuvimana!<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Vyoseri vyatuwera navi haviwusiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">womberi wahowa kayi pota kuwera na luhala.<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Ayubu gushemi guloli pagwana yakakwakula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Ndo gaa pakati pa malaika hakizi kukutanga?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Kutula utama mumoyu kumlaga mzigizyigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">na weya umlaga mpungasesi.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Neni namweni nimwona mzigizyigi kawera na mpatiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">kumbiti vumu mpangilu zihalibisiya numba zakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Wana wakuyi wahera uponera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">wasinda kumahakama na kwahera wantu wa kuwateteya.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Viboga vyakuyi waliya yawana njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">ata viboga yavimeriti pakati pa misontu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">Yawanamatamata wawufira nentu ulunda wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Toziya ntabiku yizandiri kulawa muudongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">pota ntabiku itomolandiri kulawa mulitapaka<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Kumbiti muntu kiwuka katabiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">ndo handa nsesi za motu yaziguluka kugenda kunani.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Handa meweri gwenga menimluwi Mlungu kantangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">menimgambili yomberi ntabiku yangu.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Yomberi katenda mirandu mikulu yayimanikandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">na makangashu yagawezandiri kuwalangika.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Kayitowera mvula isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">kankujega mashi mumalambu<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Kawanyasula panani yawalisulisiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">na yawadaya wapananwa nemeru.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Kayimeganga mipangu ya wanampayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">matendu gawu nagawera na mpatiru.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Kawabata yawana luhala mumahala gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">mipangu yawapayira kayiyasila kutali.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Womberi wawona luwindu shaka sha paluwala, wapapasiya paluwala gambira pashiru<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Kumbiti Mlungu kankuwalopola wahushu nawalagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">nakuwawusiya kulawa muwantu yawana likakala.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Su kawapanana wahushu litumbiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">na ukontola umalirwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Katekelerwa muntu yulii Mlungu yakamkomanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Su nagulema makomangu ga Mtuwa Mlungu Yakana makakala.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Mana yomberi katenda na viraa kalwaziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">kakweshula na kwa liwoku lyakuyi kaponiziya.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Handa payiwera matabisiya gakwizila mala sita hakalopoli, kwahela mlandu mdoda gwanakupati ata pagukwizira mala zivuwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Shaka sha njala hakakulopoli na kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">munkondu nkulu hakakulopoli.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Wantu pawakwigilanga hakakuloleri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">pota kutira ntabiku payiza.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Shaka sha ntabiku na njala paviza, haguseki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">pota kutira wankanyama wakalipa wa isi.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Mabuwi ga kumalambu hapeni gakuleweleri kulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">pota wankanyama wakalipa hapeni wakukangali.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Haguweri na ponga munumba mwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">na mifugu yaku yoseri hayiweri palaa,<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Haguwoni viraa wiwuka waku hawaweli wavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">wavuwa gambira mihamba muisi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Haguhowi paguwera mzewi nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">gambira nganu yayikamaliti.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Su mirandu ayi tuyilola, ndo nakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">hangu guyipikinili mana hayikutangi.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwakula Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kamwankula Elifazi. <verse eid="JOB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />Handa utama waneni mewupimwi, ntabiku zyaneni zoseri mezitulwi mushipimiru,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />meviweri vitopa kuliku mhanga gwa kumpwani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">Ndo mana visoweru vyangu ndo vya vuluvulu.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Misali ya Mlungu insoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">shimba yaneni ilanda usungu wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Vitiliziya vya Mlungu vinfata.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Punda kawezandiri kulira pakawera na ntundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">ama ng'ombi pakawera na maliwiziwu.<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Hashi, shintu yashinogandiri washiliya pota munu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Ama ufufu wa ligi una unoga woseri?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Nahera hamu ya shiboga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">na kila shintu shandiya shintenda ndwali.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Handa Mlungu mekampanani shilii shanimluwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">Nfira Mlungu kanankuli luwa yangu,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Handa Mlungu mekafiri kumpondamponda, su mekandagi mweni!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Mekatendi hangu mekanyamaziyi moyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">meweri na nemeru mukutama kukalipa handa weriti ndiri nivilema visoweru vyakuyi. Yomberi yakaweriti Mnanagala. <verse eid="JOB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Kumbiti nahera makakala ga kwendeleya kulikala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">Ntambu gaa nendeleyi kulikala.<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Hashi, neni wumbwitwi kwa mabuwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">Ama nshimba yaneni inyawitwi kwa shaba?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Nakaka nahera makakala goseri ga kuntanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">mana utanga woseri uwusiwa kwa neni.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Muntu yakawera muntabiku kafiriti nentu waganja wakuyi wamtangi, ata pakaleka kumguwira Mlungu yakana likakala.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Waganja waneni wampayira gambira lushemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">wampayira gambira mifereji yahera mashi.<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Nshemba azi zimema balafu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">na seluji ilififa mngati mwakuyi<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Kumbiti shaka sha livuki ilumbujuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">na shaka sha mpepu nshemba ziyuma.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Miyanja ya washuwuza waleka njira pawasakula mashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">wankuzyengeta kushiwala na kuhowera aku.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Wanamwanja kulawa Tema wagamira pawasakula mashi na yawashuwuza wa Sheba wankutumbira kupata mashi.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Wakalaziwa kwa kulitumbira hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">wasoka kunshemba azi na kukalala.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Mwenga muwera gambira nshemba azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">muwona mlandu gwa kutiriziya mwenga mtira.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Hashi, niwaluwiti mumpanani lifupu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">Ama mundavilili swinda su muntangi?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Ama mndopoli kulawa mumawoku ga mnkondu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">Ama mndopoli mumakakala ga yawamonera?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Munfundi, naneni hanyamali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">Mung'ambiziyi pankositi.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Visoweru vya nakaka vyana likakala likulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Kumbiti gamtakula gahera mana kwaneni.<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Hashi, mlihora kuwera muweza kuvinyawa kayi visoweru vyantakuliti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">Visoweru vya muntu yakatwezukiti ndo liyega hera.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Mwenga mjera kuwagalambulira simbi su muwapati washiwa waweri wa mwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">na muwashuhuza waganja wenu su muweri na mpatiru.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Kumbiti vinu mundoli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">Neni hapeni ntakuli mpayu kulongolu kwamwenga.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Shondi mleki ukontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">Vinu mndeki, mana neni na muheri.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Hashi, mlihola neni na mpayu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">Ama neni niwumanandiri utama?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Wantu wana mahengu gakamala pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">wafiruwa kutenda mahengu mashaka goseri gambira shibaluwa,<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />yomberi gambira mmanda yakafira shivuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">gambira muntu yakana lihengu yakahepera shibena mgongu shakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Mumiezi yoseri nahera shoseri shashiweza kuntanga kulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">pashiru mpaka pashiru nana utama.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Pangonja nonga, Hanimuki ndii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Toziya masaa ga pashiru gawera matali nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">ngalangata mushitanda mpaka pawushiya.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Nshimba yaneni imema wampekenyi na ushafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">likuli lyaneni liyuma na lilawa ufira wa lipu.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Mashaka ganeni hagaperi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">na ntumbirandiri shoseri shashintenda weri mbaka.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, makaliru ganeni gambira pumula hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">nivimana kuwera hapeni liwoni liheri lyoseri kayi.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Yakamona vinu, hapeni kamoni kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">katepu hera pagundola hanagamili.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Gambira liwundi ntambu yaliwuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">ndo handa wantu ntambu yawahowa pota kuwuya.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Hapeni kawuyi kayi kulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">na wantu wamlwaluwa.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Hangu hapeni nyamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">Hanongi galii yagawera mumoyu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">handalami kwa utama wa moyu gwangu.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Hashi, neni ndo bahari ama kanyama mkulu nentu gwa mubahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">ata guntulili ulolera?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Panonga Shitanda hashintendi noyeri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">kugonja kwaneni hakumpunguliri, malalamiku gangu,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />gwenga gwiza kuntiliziya mu kulota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">guntiliziya kwa kunjegera malola,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />su mona, mbaka nilikongeri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">kuliku kwendeleya kupata ntabiku azi.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Nkalalira kwendeleya kulikala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">Hapeni nilikali kayi. Mundeki, mana makaliru gangu shintundiri!<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Muntu ndo gaa ata gumloli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">Ntambu gaa gumhola nentu?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Gwenga gwiza kumlola kila mandawira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">kila lishaka gusoka kumjera!<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Hagwendereyi kundola mpakandii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">pota kundeka ata shididini?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Handa pantenda vidoda, vikutenda shishi gwenga yagutatira wantu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Hashi guntula kuwera shintu shagupangiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Ntambu gaa wera shisanka shaku?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Ntambu gaa gundekeziyandiri likosa lyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">na kumbusilira ukontola waneni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Sambira nankuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">hagunsakuli, hapeni gumoni kayi!<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kankutakula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Shakapanu Bilidadi muntu gwa Shuhi kamwankula Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />Hagutakuli mirandu ayi mpaka ndii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">Mpaka ndii visoweru vyaku haviweri hera handa liyega?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Gulishera Mlungu kankutenda ntambu yayifiruwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Hashi, gulihola Mlungu Yakana likakala kaweza kugalambula unakaka kuwera upayu?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Payiwera wana waku wamtendera vidoda Mungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">yomberi hakawakomangi kulawirana na gawatenditi.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Handa pagumsakula Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">na kumluwa ayu Mlungu Yakana likakala,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />handa gwenga gwana moyu guherepa na kulikala ntambu yakafira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">nakaka Mlungu hakizi kukutanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">na kukupanana pahala pakulikala yapafiriziwa.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Tembera gwanjiti kulikala na vintu vididini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">makaliru gaku ga shakapanu hagaweri gaherepa nentu.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Gulifundi kwa walii yawatulongoleriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">gutendi mirandu yawayambulitwi yawatulongoleriti.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Hangu twenga twiwuka mashaka gatangalandiri, tuvimana ndiri vintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">mashaka gatwenga pasipanu ndo shivuni yashipita.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Kumbiti womberi hawakufundi na kukugambira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">mirandu yawalifunditi.<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Mitefu imera hera papawera na mashimashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">miteti iherepa pahala pamashimashi<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Payindeleya kukula pamberi pa wantu kudumla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">na payikosa mashi miteti ayi iyuma kalongola kuliku mihambi imonga.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Ayi ndo ntambu yawawera woseri yawamwaluwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">Litumbiru lya yawamwaminindiri Mlungu halyagamiri.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Shirii shawashitumbira hashiweri shahera mana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">hashiweri handa ubunta wa buyibuyi.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Hawegemeri ubunta kumbiti hapeni uwatangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">wawukolera kumbiti ulikalandiri<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Wantu yawamleka Mlungu hawaweri gambira mtefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">payiwera panamashi na mshenji hayimeri pahala poseri.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Mishigira yakuyi iripotapota mumabuwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">na yomberi kagenda kulolalola mngati mlitalabuwi.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Kumbiti pawawusiwa awa pahala pakuyi pakulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">kwahera yakamana kuwera kuweriti nawa.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Guloli, awu ndo upeleru wa nemeleru ya wantu awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">na pahala pakuyi hapaweri na wantu wamonga.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Guloli! Mlungu hapeni kamlemi muntu yakahera likosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">pota hapeni kawatangi wantu wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Su hakakutendi guweri na sekeleru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">na hakakutendi guweri na nemeleru.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Walii yawakukalalira hawawoni soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">pahala pa kulikala wantu wakontola hapagamiri nakamu.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwankula Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kankula,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />Nakaka nivimana hangu ndo ntambu yayiwera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Kumbiti muntu kaweza hashi kuwera mheri kulongolu kwa Mlungu?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Handa muntu mekajeri kusingana na yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">kawezindiri kusoka patali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">hapeni kawezi kwankula likosiwu limu pakati pa elufu.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Yomberi kana luhala nentu na makakala gavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">gaa yakasinganiti na yomberi na kakanka?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Yomberi kahamiziya migongu pota yeni kuvimana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">kayibomolera kutali kwa maya gakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Yomberi kapatikisiya pasipanu kulawa pahala pakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">na mpanda zyakuyi zilendemera.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Kagugambira mshenji nagulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">kagibikira ntondu naziwala.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Yomberi gweka yakuyi ndo yakatuliti mpindi pahala pakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">na kugatimba makupala ga bahari.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Yomberi katuliti vipinga vya ntondu mulyera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">Dubu na Orioni na Kilimia na ntondu za kusika<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Yomberi ndo yakatenda mirandu mikulu yayimanikandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">mirandu ya kulikangasha yayiwalangikandiri.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Guloli Mtuwa Mlungu kankupita pakwegera naneni nimwonandiri, shakapanu kagenda zyakuyi pota neni kummana.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Yomberi pakatola shakafira, gaa yakaweza kumlewelera?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Gaa yakaweza kumkosiya, gwangutenda shishi?<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Mlungu hapenikaleweleri maya gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">Njoka yumonga gwa kubahali na watanga wakuyi hawasuntami pasi palongolu pakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Su, hamwezi hashi kumwankula Mlungu? Hasyaguli koshi visoweru vya kumgambira?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Tembera nahera likosa, wezandiri kumwankula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">hanimluwi kamoneri lusungu yomberi Mlungu yakawera mtoza gwangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Tembera nimshema, yomberi kankula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">manitindiri kuwera mekampikiniri.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Yomberi kalagalila liyega likalipa su lindagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">kongera vironda vya neni pota toziya<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Kandekandiri noyeri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">makaliru gangu kagamemiziya utama.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Handa kusingana, yomberi kana makakala nentu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Ata kusakula galii gamfiruwa kupata, gaa hakamjegi pamahakama?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Tembera nahera likosa, visoweru vyangu namweni mevintozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">tembera nahera vidoda mekananguziyi kuwera mpotuziya.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Tembera nahera vidoda, nililolandiri namweni, Kumbiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">Nigakalalira makaliru gangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Goseri gapamuhera ndo mana ntakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">Mlungu kawagamiziya waheri na wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Shaka makomangu pagajega kuhowa kwa vumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">Mlungu kajongera kuwuya kumberi kwa ulii yakahera likosa.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Isi payikolwamlima na mkontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Mlungu kadiwa masu ga watoza wakuyi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Handa Mlungundiri gaa yanakatendi hangu?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />Mashaka gangu gagenda kalongola kuliku muntu yakatuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">katuga pota kuwona mirandu miheri.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Makaliru gangu gapita kalongola handa ngalawa mumashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">gambira ngashanga yakagulukira vyakuwinga.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Pantakula, hanililwaluwi malalamiku gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">hangalambuli sheni shangu sha hinginiku su weri na nemereru!<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />Kumbiti ntira ntabiku yangu yoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">nivimana kuwera Mlungu hakamoni kuwera nahera likosa.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Handa pantozwa kuwera na likosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">ntambu gaa niligazii?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Ata paniligulula kwa sabuni na kulitakasiya mawoku kwa mashi gaherepa,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />ata, pakampatuziya mulilindi lyana ushafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">na nguwu zyangu namweni hazinemi.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Mlungu ndo muntundiri ata nimwankuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">ata tuwezandiri kugenda nayu kumahakama.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Kumbiti kwahera mwamulira pakati petu, mweni mekaamuwi pakati petu twenga wawili.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Kwahera muntu yakaweza kumbera Mlungu kunkomanga neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">na shitiliziwu shakuyi nashintula neni lyoga!<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Kumbiti mewezi kutakula na yomberi pota kumtira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">mana nivimana ntambu yawera mumoyu mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Nigakalalira nentu makaliru gangu aga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Malalamiku gangu hanongi pota shilewaleru.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Hanongi ntambu yagawera mumoyu mwangu mana gana utama.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Hanimgambiri Mlungu, naguntoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">Gung'ambili handa gwana masitaka gaa na neni.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Hashi, ndo iherepa kwa gwenga kumonera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">kugambeza mahengu ga mawoku gaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">na kuyipendeleya mipangu ya wakontola?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Hashi, gwana masu handa muntu? Guwona vintu ntambu yakawona muntu?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Hashi, mashaka gaku gambira ga muntu? Ama vinja vyaku handa vya muntu?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Ata guwulolalola ukontola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">na kuvisakula vidoda vyangu?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Gwenga guvimana kuwera neni nahera likosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">na kwahera gwa kundopola kulawa mumawoku gaku.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />Mawoku gaku gantenda weri ntambu yawera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">kumbiti vinu gugalambuka na kunagamiziya.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Guliholi kuwera guwumbiti kwa litapaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">Hashi, hagumbuziyi kayi mumadikudiku?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Su, gumpanana makakala tati gwangu su wampati neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">Guntenda nkuli mumtima mwa mawu gwangu?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Guwumbiti nshimba yangu kwa mihonju na mishipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">guyigibikira mihonju ya neni kwa shinofu na likuli.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Gumpanana ukomu na kuntendera maheri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">muulolera waku guyiponiziya rohu yangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Ata mirandu ayi guyififiti mumoyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">Kumbiti nivimana kuwera ayi meyiweri nfiru yaku.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Guweriti gwankuhepelera su gumoni handa hantendi vidoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">su gulemi kundekiziya ukontola wangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Handa neni ndo mkontola, hantabiki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Handa payiwera neni ntenda yagafiruwa, mbezandiri kulizyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">toziya mema soni, panikulola kutabika kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Handa panilitenda nashikambaku, haguwingi gambira simba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">na kumposhola kayi kwa mauzauza gaku.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Kila mala gunjegera ukapitawu su wandiwiri neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">na kongera maya gaku kwa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">gunjegera wankondu wasyayi wankomangi.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />Gwee Mlungu, ntambu gaa gundekiti neni niwuki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Mbaka mehowi pamberi pa wantu kumona.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Menjegwi mulisembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">pawera handa muntu yakaweritindiri.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Hashi, mashaka ga makaliru gangu madidinindiri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">Gundeki nilinomi.<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Pamberi pa kugenda aku kweni hapeni mbuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">aku kuisi ya hinginiku na luwindu totolu,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />isi ya hinginiku na ndewi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">kweni uweru wakuyi ndo handa luwindu.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Visoweru vya Sofari</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Shakapanu Sofari muntu gwa isi ya Namati kamwankula Ayubu pakalonga,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />hashi, uvuwa awu wa visoweru ulekwi hera pota kuwankulwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Muntu gwa visoweru vivuwa kalanguziya handa kahera likosa?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Gulihola visoweru vyaku vivuwa havinyamaziyi wantu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Handa pagujongera, hashi kwahera yakakukalipira?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Gwenga gutakula, kuwera shagulongiti sha nakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">nahera likosa palongolu pa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Mbaka Mlungu mekatakuli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">kulaviya liziwu lyakuyi kukwankula!<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />Mekakugambili kuwera luhala lyana wega zivuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">kwana mirandu ya mungati nentu mumahala ga muntu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">Guvimani kuwera Mlungu hakakukomangi kwa makosa gagugatenditi.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />Hashi, guweza kuyambula bada za Mlungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">na kuvimana mbaka za Mlungu yakana likakala?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Makakala ga Mlungu gapita mpindi, gwenga guvimana shishi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Mlungu kakumana ata kumambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">gwenga guweza kuvimana shishi?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Ukulu wa Mlungu upita utali wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">kayi upita upana wa bahari.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Handa Mlungu pakapita, kamtawa muntu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">handa pakiza nakukujega kumahakama, gaa yakaweza kumlewelera?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Mlungu kawamana wantu yawafaandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">pakawona makontola yomberi katenda shintu.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Mzigizigi kawezandiri kuwera na umani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">Handa punda gwa kuntundu kawezandiri kulera muntu.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Ayubu, paguwera mwaminika kwa Mlungu, hagunyasuli mawoku gaku na kumluwa Mlungu!<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Payiwera gwana vidoda guleki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">Nagujimira udoda uweri munumba mwaku.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Shakapanu, hapaguweri na soni, hagugoloki kwa ugangamala pota lyoga.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Haguliwaluwi ntabiku zaku zoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">haguziholi gambira malawa yagapititi.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Makaliru gaku hagang'ering'eti kuliku mshenji gwa paluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">luwindu lwakuyi halugalambuki kuwera mng'ering'etu gwa kushiya.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Haguweli na ponga toziya kwana litumbiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">hagulolelwi na kulikala poneka.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Hagugonji pota kutiliziwa na muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">wantu wavuwa hawakuluwi utanga.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Kumbiti wakontola masu gawu hagawonindiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">njira zoseri za kutolokera hazagamili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">litumbiru lyawu lya upeleru ndo kuhowa.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwankula Sofari</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kankula:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />Nakaka, mwenga ndo wantu wa luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">Luhala haluperi shaka shilii pamhowa.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Neni nivimana gambira mwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Ata neni nana mahala handa mwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Goseri gamtakuliti kila muntu kagamana.<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Waganja waneni wankunseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">neni nimluwiti Mlungu na kanankula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">neni nana haki na kutakulwa shidoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">wera muntu gwa kusekwa na wantu<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Yomberi yakikuta kawaholerandiri wana njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">kwa walii yawawera na shiwembu wawera na ntabiku nentu.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Kumbiti wapoka walitenda kuwera wana ponga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">Yawamsoziya Mlungu waliwona waponeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">makakala gawu ndo wamlungu wawu.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Kumbiti guwakosiyi wankanyama na womberi hawakufundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">guwakosiyi wampongu na womberi hawakugambili,<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Ama guyikosiyi isi yeni hayikufundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">guzumbi na wasomba wa muhabari naweni hawakugambili.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Gaa pakati pa viwumbi avi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">yakavimanandiri kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu katenda aga?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Ukomu wa kila shiwumbi wa mumawoku mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">ntambu iraa na pumla ya ukomu wa muntu.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Hashi, likutu lipimandiri visoweru</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">gambira lulimi ntambu yalulawilira shiboga?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Wazewi wana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">na walii yawalikaliti shaka shitangala wana luhala.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Kumbiti luhala na uwezu ndo vya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">yomberi kana mahala na umani.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Mlungu pakabomola, kwahera yakaweza kunyawa kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">pakamtawa muntu, kwahera yakaweza kumyopola.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Handa Mlungu pakalewelera mvula, isi iyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">pakayivugulira, isi ipata malawa.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Yomberi kana makakala na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">yawapayilwa na wazyanga woseri ndo wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Kawatenda watakuziya wawoni soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">kawatenda walonguziya kuwera wazyigizyigi.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Kawawusilira wafalumi ukolamlima wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">na kuwatenda wamanda.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Kawatenda watambika wawoni soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">na kuwagusiya wana makakala.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Kawapoka watakuziya uwezu wa kuyowera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">kawusiya luhala kwa wazewi.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Kawatenda wakolamlima waweri na soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">na kuwawusilira wana uwezu makakala gawu.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Kawalanguziya wantu vintu vyaviweriti kubada</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">na kugajega kuweru yagaweriti kuluwindu.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Kawatenda wantu wa isi waweri na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">shakapanu kawalaga.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Kawawusilira walonguziya umani wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">kawatenda wayeriyeri kushiwala pahera njira,<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Wajera kutyanga mluwindu pahala yapahera kulangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">na kuwatenda wawegukiweguki gambira walowera.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Guloli goseri aga nigawona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">Makutu gangu gapikinira na kuvimana.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Goseri yamugamana, neni viraa nigamana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">Kwahera shintu shamushimana shanishimanandiri neni.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Kumbiti nananfiru ya kutakula na Mlungu yakana likakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">nfira kuliteteya kulongolu kwa Mlungu,<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Kumbiti goseri gamtakula kwa neni ndo mpayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">mwenga ndo waganga yamponiziyandiri.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Mbaka mnyamali nakamu, mimuwoneki handa mwana luhala!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Vinu mmpikaniri shantakula neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">mpikaniri ntambu yaniliteteya.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Hashi, mlishera mwankumtakulira Mlungu kwa kutakula mpayu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">Mlihola kulonga kwa kuzyanga kumfiriziya Mlungu?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Hashi, mjera kumpendeleya Mlungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Hashi, hammuteteyi Mlungu kushotera motu?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Hashi, pakawakagula mwenga hamponi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Ama mlihola muweza kumpayira Mlungu ntambu yamwazyanga wantu wamonga?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Nakaka yomberi hakawakalapiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">handa pamlanguziya upendelewu kwa bada.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Hashi, ukulu wakuyi uwatiliziyandiri mwenga? Hashi, mumtirandiri?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Mitakulu yenu yahera mana handa malivu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">visoweru vyenu vyahera makakala na mana.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Mnyamali, naneni yoweri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">Yalifirakundawira lindawiri.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Neni nakala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">kwa goseri yanagandawiri,<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Ata Mlungu pakandaga, nahera lya kupotiziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">Nakaka hanimgambiri neni nahera makosa.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ayi ndo hayiweri kupona kwaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">mana yakamguwirandiri Mlungu hapeni kasegeleri kulongolu kwakuyi!<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Mpikaniri weri visoweru vyangu na vyantakula visoki mmakutu mwenu.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Kumbiti vinu mirandu yangu niyitula kala weri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">mana nahera makosa.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Gaa hakavilemi visoweru vyangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Handa kwanayu neni hanyamali na kuhowa.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Mlungu gwangu, guntenderi mawili aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">na neni hapeni nilififi patali na gwenga.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Gumbusilili liwoku lyaku lyalinkomanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">naguleki kuntiliziya.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Su gutakuli na neni hanikwankuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">Ama nanji neni, nagwenga gunankuli.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Hashi makosa na vidoda vyangu ndo vininga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Gunanguziyi makosa na vidoda vyangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Hashi gulififa nanikuwona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">na ntambugaa guntenda handa mnkondu gwaku?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Hashi, hagulutendi luhamba lukutiri gambira luhamba liyuma lwaligulusiwa na lyega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">ama kuyitugiziya miwawi?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Gwenga gulaviya mirandu itama kulongolu kwaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">na kumpapiziya vidoda vya untemba wa neni.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Guntawalira minyololu mumagulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">kugasungulira maleka ga njira zyangu zoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">na lwayu zyangu guzitulira upeleru.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Hangu muntu kagamira handa shintu shashiwoliti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">gambira nguwu yayiliyitwi na wamehi.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Muntu yakiwukiti na mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">kalikala mashaka madidini na geni gamema ntabiku.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Gabuma handa uluwa, shakapanu ganyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">Gatuga handa shivuni na kwagamira.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Gwee Mlungu ntambu gaa gulishera ata kumlola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">Na kunjega kumahakama?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Gaa yakaweza kulaviya shintu shiherepa kulawa mushintu shidoda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Kwahera yakaweza.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Mashaka ga kulikala muntu gapimwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">gwee Mlungu, guyipanga walanga wa miyezi yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">muntu kawezandiri kupita upeleru wagumtuliriti.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Guloli pambwega na gumleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">su kapati kunemelera mashaka gakuyi gambira shibaluwa.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Mana mtera pagudumulwa, kwana litumbiru lya kutomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">mana ntomolu zakuyi hapazileki kutomola kayi.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Tembera mishigira yakuyi payiwera migona mulitapaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">na mishigira yakuyi kuwolera mulitapaka,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />kumbiti pagupata mashi hagutomoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">hagulaviyi mintambi gambira shitomolu.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Kumbiti muntu pakahowa na awu ndo upeleru wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">Pakalaviya kala rohu kasigalwa na shishi kayi?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Handa mashi ntambu yagayuma mulitanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">ama lushemba paluleka kunyiririka,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />ndo ntambu yakahowa muntu, pota hapakimuki kayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">Wantu hapawimuki ama kwimusiwa mu mpota zyawu.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Meyiweri mbaka gunfifi kumambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">mpaka maya gaku pagapolaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">mbaka meguntuliri shaka na shakapanu kuhola kayi.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Hashi muntu pakahowa kawuya kayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Handa meyiweri hangu neni meheperi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">mpaka shaka shangu sha ntabiku pashipera.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Megushemi, naneni menitiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">shaka gwenga pagufira kumona neni mana neni nashiwumbi shaku.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Panu meguwezi kuwalanga maleka gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">na meguleki kulolalola vidoda vyangu,<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Makosa gangu megugalekeziyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">na kugafifa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Kumbiti handa migongu ntambu yayimomonyoka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">na matalabuwi gatupuka pahala pakuyi<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />Kutuga kwa mashi kuliya matalabuhi, mvula nkulu itenda kumong'onyoka kwa litapaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">Ndo gwenga ntambu yaguhalibisiya litumbiru lya muntu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Gwenga guwusiya ukomu wa muntu na yomberi kagamira mashaka goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">gushigalambula sheni shakuyi na kumwasira patali.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Wana wakuyi pawagohilika, yomberi kavimanandiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">Pawapatuziwa, yomberi kawonandiri.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Kapikanira utama kwa nshimba yakuyi hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">na kulidayilira hera ntambu yakuyi idoda.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi kankuyowera kayi na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1-21:34</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Shakapanu Elifazi, muntu gwa Temani kankula,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />hashi mumtu yakana luhala kankula pota kulihola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">na visoweru vyakuyi vyahera mana?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Hashi, yakana luhala kalitakulira kwa visoweru yavifaandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">ama kwa visoweru vyahera mana?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Kumbiti gwenga gubeziya kumguwira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">na gulewelera kumholera Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Ukontola waku ndo yawukufunda kutakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">na gwenga gusyagula kutakula gambira wazyanga.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Visoweru vyaku gamweni vikutoza, nenindiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">matakula gaku gakutakulira gwamweni.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Hashi, gwenga ndo muntu gwa kwanja kwiwuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">Ama gwenga gwiwukiti pamberi pa kunyawa migongu?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Hashi, guweriti pashotera motu sha Mlungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">Ama gwenga gweka yaku yagwana luhala?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Gushimana shintu gaa yatushimanandiri twenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">Gushimana shintu gaa yatushimanandiri twenga?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Pakati petu kwana wazewi wana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">wana vinja vivuwa kuliku tati gwaku.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Hashi, Mlungu kugutenda moyu gwaku gunemeleri ndo shididini nentu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">Ama shisoweru shakuyi sha kutakula mpolimpoli ndo shintundiri?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Hashi moyu gwaku gukutenda gukalala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">na kulaviya masu jodu,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />ata kumgalambuka Mlungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">na kutakula visoweru vidoda gambira avi?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Muntu ndo gaa, ata kawezindiri kuwera na likosa kulongolu kwa Mlungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">Yomberi yakiwukiti na mdala, kaweza hashi kuwera muntu mheri?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Payiwera Mlungu kawaminindiri ata malaika wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">Na mpindi ziherepa ndiri kulongolu kwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />Hayiweri, muntu yakawera mdoda na mpotuziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">muntu yakatenda ukontola handa kulanda mashi!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Vinu gumpikiniri, naneni hanikulanguziyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">hanikugambiri galii gamoniti,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />mafunda ga wana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">mirandu yeni wazewi wawu wayififandiri,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Weni Mlungu kawapanana isi ayi gweka yawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">pota kwahera mhenga yakapititi pakati pawu.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Mkontola hakatabiki kwa utama mashaka goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">vinja vyoseri vyawapangilitwi wangesera.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Maziwu ga kutiriziya hagamtenderi umatu mumakutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">pakalishera kanambatiru mwagamiziya hakamkankali.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Mkontola kahera litumbiru lya kulawa kuluwindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">upeleru wakuyi ndo kuhowa kwa ligumba.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Kayerayera kusakula shiboga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">pakalonga, Shakoshi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">Kavimana kuwera lishaka lya luwindu lyapakwegera.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Ntabiku na kutama, vimtiriziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">vimgendera gambira lishonta lya mfalumi yakakomanga.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Toziya katalipisiya liwoku lyakuyi kwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">Kankulitumba kuwera kaweza kumnkaka Mlungu Yakana likakala,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Katugiti kwa mtiti kumkomanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">agawu kana lusegeyu lukulu lugangamala.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Sheni shakuyi kashinenepeziya kwa lipaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">na shunu shakuyi shimema lipaki.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Kumbiti hakalikali mumiji ya mahami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">munumba zyazikaliritwi ndiri na muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">numba zyazifilitwi ziweri limamatiru lya uhalibisiya.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Muntu ayu hapeni kaweri mlundamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">pota ulundamali wakuyi hapeni uwendeleyi kulikala pasipanu.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Hapeni kalushapili luwindu lya kuhowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Lipulipu za motu haziyumiziyi ntomolu zakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">uluwa wakuyi hawugulusiwi na lyega.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Mbaka kaleki kutumbira uzigizigi na kulizyanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">mana uzigizigi hawuweri ndo lifupu lyakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Hakalipwi pota kupungulwa shoseri pambeli pa kuhowa kwakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">na wiwuka wakuyi hapeni walikali.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Hakaweri gambira mzabibu yagutulusiya zabibu mbisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">gambira mzeyituni gwagupulutusiya uluwa wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Woseri yawamguwirandiri Mlungu hapeni wapati wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">motu hagulunguziyi malingu ga watola swinda.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Wantu awa wapanga mipangu ya ukontola na kulera madoda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">Mumioyu yawu imema uzyanga.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwankula Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kamwankula hangu,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />Mpikinira mirandu gambira ayi ivuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">goseri gamntendera niliwoni weri neni gantabisiya.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Ndii upeleru wa visoweru vyahera mana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">Ndo shishi shashiwasonguziya kunankula?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Handa mwenga memuweri mtabika handa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">mewezi kutakula gambira mwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">na kutunga visoweru vya upaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">na kutikisiya mtuyi gwangu.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Meniwatendi muliwoni weri kwa visoweru vyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">na visoweru vyangu meviwatendi mnyamali mumoyu.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Kumbiti pantakula utama wangu hapawupoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">na panyamala hapeni uwuki.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Mlungu kansakaziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">kawalaga nakamu wantu wa numba yangu.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Kantenda nondi na awu ndo ukapitawu kwa neni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">Konda kwaneni kuwatenda wantu walihola nana vidoda.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Mlungu kakwalambula kwa maya na kunema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">kalanguziya maya gakuyi gakalipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">toziya yomberi kawera handa mnkondu gwangu yakanjodolera masu.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Wantu wantakula kwa beziya na kunseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">vipinga kwa vipinga vinzyengeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">na kunkoma mapopu mmasaya.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Mlungu kandeka mbatwi na wankondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">na kandula mmawoku ga wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Weriti nkala kwa ponga, kumbiti Mlungu kamegangameganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kankabiti na kumpantanga vipandi vipandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kantenditi shintu sha kugumira misali yakuyi,<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />kanasiliti misali kulawa kila uwega.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">Kampanta figu pota lusungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">na mwazi gwangu kita pasi.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Kendeleya kuntenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">na kankomanga gambira mnkondu yakankalalira nentu.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Nilisonera nguwu ya mafafa, kulanguziya nankudaya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">uweru wangu udodiziwa na mmadikudiku.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Sheni shangu shiwera shisheri toziya ya kulira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">ngopi zyangu ziwera ntitu pii,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Tembera ntendandiri ukontola kwa mawoku gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">na maluwa gangu kwa Mlungu ndo gaherepa.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Gwee pasipanu, nagugugibikira makosa gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">na kulira kwaneni kupalasiwa kila pahala.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Nana unakaka kuwera nanayu mkapitawu gwangu kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">gwa kundeteya ka kumpindi.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Waganja wangu wambeziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">ndawa masozi kumluwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Mepaweri Muntu mekanteteyi kulongolu kwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">ntambu yayitendeka pasipanu pakati pa wantu wawili.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Vinja vyangu visigala vididika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">naneni hang'endi aku kweni hapeni mbuyi.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Moyu gwangu gutwezuka, mashaka gangu gapera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">lisembi lyangu lya kala.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Nakaka yawanjongera wazyengeta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">kunjongera kwawu nikuwona pota kufifa.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Gwee Mlungu guntangi, weri lekeru kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">Mana kwahera yumonga gwa kuntanga.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Mana gugatawa mahala ga waganja wa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">naguwaleka wakanki.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Muntu yakawagalambuka waganja wakuyi kwa senti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">wana wakuyi hawaweri lwisi.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Ndendwa kuwera lidufiya kwa wantu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">nwera muntu gwa kutemerwa mata.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Masu gangu gatifutifu kwa utama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">viwungiru vyangu vyoseri viwera handa shivuni.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Wantu wa Mlungu walikangasha pawagawona aga gagandawira neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">wantu yawaherandiri na likosa wakalaziwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">na yawamtirandiri Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Hangu, mwaminika kakolelera shilii shakatakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">muntu yakatenda maheri kongereka kuwera na likakala nentu.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Kumbiti mwenga mjeri kayi mawoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">Kwa mwenga hapeni nimpati yakana luhala ata yumu.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Mashaka gangu gapera, mipangu yangu imegwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">matumbiru ga moyu gwangu gawuka.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Kwa waganja waneni walonga pashiru ndo palwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">Wamanandiri kulangala pota luwindu.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Handa kumambi ndo numba ya neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">na pakaya pangu paluwindu panu,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />payiwera nilishema lisembi tati gwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">na mbekenyu, mawu gwangu ama dada gwangu,<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Hashi, hansigali na litumbiru gaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Ndo gaa yakaweza kuwona litumbiru ali?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Ali litumbiru lyangu halisuluki na neni kumambi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">Hatuseleri twawoseri wawili mpaka aku kulidikudiku!<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi katakula kayi na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Shakapanu Bilidadi, muntu gwa Shuhi kankula.<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />Hagusakuli visoweru vya kutakula mpaka ndii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">Guliholi weri na twenga hatutakuli.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Ntambu gaa, gututenda gambira wankanyama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">Hashi gutuwona twenga kuwera wazigizigi?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Gwenga gulipapula gamweni kwa maya gaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Ntambu gaa pasipanu palekwi hera toziya yaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">ama matalabuwi gahamiziwi kulawa pahala pakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />Koloboyi ya muntu mkontola izimiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">mlipulipu gwa motu gwakuyi haguzimiki.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Munumba yakuyi kulangala ndo luwindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">na koloboyi yayimyakira hayizimwi.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Maleka gakuyi matali hagafupiziwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">mipangu yakuyi hayimgusiyi pasi.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Lwayu zakuyi mweni hazimgomiziyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">kila pakagendagenda hakapatukili mlirindi.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Mgomiziwu gumbata mshisukulumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">lugoyi lumkongera ng'ering'eri.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Kafifirwa ligoyi lwa kumgomiziya mulitapaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">kayambirwa mgomiziwu munjira yakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Lyoga likulu limtiriziya kila uwega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">limfata mukila lileka lyakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Kaweriti na ulunda, kumbiti vinu kana njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">matenduwa gakala kumgusiya.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Ulweri udoda wankuliya likuli lyakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">malweri yagajega kuhowa galiya viwungiru vyakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Wakontola woseri hawatupurwi muliringu lyakuyi lyakalitumbiriti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">na kujegwa kwa mfalumi gwa kutiliziya.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Motu hagupambiri kila shintu muliringu lyakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">motu gwa shibiriti haguweri kila pahala munumba zawu.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Yomberi gambira mtera yaguyumiti mishigira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">ntambi zakuyi pampindi zinyala.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Muisi kwahera yakafira kumhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">litawu lyakuyi hapeni likantwi kayi mnjira.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Mkontola hakawusiwi muulangala na kwasirwa mluwindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">kawingwa kutali kulawa pasipanu.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Kahela wana pota wazukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">kwahera yakasigaliti pakaya pakuyi,<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Wantu wa kwaguzyetera mshenji walikangasha kwa galii yagampatiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">lyoga haliwapati wantu wa kwagulawira mshenji.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Aga ndo galii yagawapatiti yawamsherandiri Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">Panu ndo pahala palii wantu yawamanandiri Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwankula kayi Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kankula.<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />Hamwendereyi kuntabisiya mpaka ndii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">na kumegangamenga kwa visoweru vyenu?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Mala zoseri azi kumi munigiranga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">Hashi muwonandiri soni kuntendera vidoda?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Handa meweriti nkosa nakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">likosa lyangu ndo lyangu namweni.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Muntenda moneki nahera mana su mwenga muwoneki wa mana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">munigiranga kwa kulinanagaziwa kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Mvimani kuwera Mlungu kantendera madoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">na kumbata mumgomiziwu gwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Tembera ndira ntenderwa madoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">kumbiti nankulitwindiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">Tembera nduwa utanga kumbiti mpatandiri shanfiruwa kupanana.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Mlungu kadiwa njira ya neni nampita</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">kazitula luwindu njira za neni.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Kawusiya ulunda wa neni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">na kantenda nampananwa ligoya.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Kamega wega zoseri naneni mpera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">kaliwusiya litumbiru lyangu gambira mtera.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Mlungu kankalalira nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">na kamona gambira mnkondu gwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Wamashonta wakuyi wanizira pamuhera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">wanyawa njira kwiza kwa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">wanyawa ngonjeru kuzyengeta numba yaneni.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Mlungu kawatula walongu wangu kutali na neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">waganja wangu wapamuherandiri na neni.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Walongu wangu na waganja wangu wantangandiri kayi.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Wahenga mnumba mwaneni wandyaluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">wayaya wangu wamona gambira namuhenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">Kwa womberi wera muntu yawamanandiri.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Nimshema ntumintumi gwangu kumbiti kitikandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">ata panimluwiti kantangi kanankula ndiri.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Mdala gwangu kalonga pumula yangu inunka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">walongu wangu wakala kutali na neni.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Ata wana wadidini wambeziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">pandawira womberi wambolera.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Waganja wangu wapakwegera wakalaziwa naneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">walii yawaweriti niwafira wangalambuka.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Nshimba yaneni isigala mihonju na likuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">mponera padidika hera kuhowa.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Mumoneri lusungu, mumoneri lusungu mwenga waganja waneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">mana Mlungu kantenda ntabiki.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Namunkomanga Mlungu ntambu yakankomanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Ntambu gaa mtosiwandiri na nshimba yaneni?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Meyiweri mbaka visoweru vyangu mevilembwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">Mevilembwi mushitabu!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Meyiweri mbaka visoweru vyangu mevisongorwi kwa shuma na lisasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">pampindi pa libuwi su vikali mashaka goseri!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Nivimana kuwera mlopola gwangu mkomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">upeleru yomberi hakanteteyi pasipanu.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Ata likuli lyangu palihalibisiwa hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">pawera nankali na shimba ayi hanimwoni Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Haniliwoni na yomberi,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 19:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">namweni neni pota muntu yumongandiri. Gulori moyu gwangu gwana nfiru na gwenga<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Waganja wangu namlihola kuwera njira zamuntendera su nendereyi kutabika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">Mwenga mlonga aga nilifilira namweni ntabiku<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Kumbiti mwenga maweni mtira makomangu, mana nkalaliru ijega makomangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">shakapanu mwenga hammani kuwera Mlungu ndo mtoza.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">Sofari kankutakula kayi na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Shakapanu Sofari, muntu gwa Naamati, kankula.<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />Maholu gangu gantenda nikwankuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">toziya nsinda kunyamala.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Shagung'ambira ndo mayigalangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">kumbiti niyimana ntambu ya kunkwankula.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Nakaka gulyaluwa mlandu agu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">kwanjira makashu Mlungu pakamuumbiti muntu pasipanu,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />Mkontola hakaliwoni kasinda katepu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">nemelera yakuyi yakamguwira ndiri Mlungu ndo shaka shididini hera!<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Hakaliholi kuwera yomberi ndo mkulu kuliku woseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">mekalitumbi toziya ya ligoya lyakapananwa na wantu,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />Kumbiti hawamwasiri kutali gambira mapimba gakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">Yawammaniti hawalikosiyi ka koshi?<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Hakagamili handa kulota, hapenikawoneki kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">hakafutiki gambira malola ga pashiru.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Yakamwoniti, hapenikamwoni kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">pota pakalikaliti hapeni pamamaniki kayi.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Ulamweni hakawuziyi lunda yakuyi yoseri yakawapokiti wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">wana wakuyi hawaluwi utanga kwa wahushu.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Tembera kalipikanira kamema makakala ga untemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">kumbiti zoseri hazigonji pamuhera na yomberi mulidikudiku.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Mkontola kanemelera kutenda vintu vidoda, gambira kuliya shiboga shinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">pakamalira kutenda ukontola kendeleya kulihola awu,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />kalema kuulekeziya nawugenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">ila kawukolera mumlomu mwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />Kumbiti pawusoka mumtima uwera ukalipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">ukalipa gambira usungu wa njoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Mkontola kamira lunda zakiwiti na kuzihukula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Mlungu hakazilaviyi mumtima gwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Shakazulumiti muntu mkontola kwakuyi ndo gambira usungu wa njoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">hakalaguwi kwa kulumwa na njoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Hapeni kalikali na kuwona uvuwa wa mpatiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">pota hapawawoni ntekelera na ulunda.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Vyoseri vyakavipatiti hakaviwuziyi pota kuviliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">hapenikavinemeleri vintu vyakavitenderiti lihengu,<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />toziya kawagamiziya wahushu na kuwaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">kawapoka numba zakazinyawitindiri.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Mashaka goseri hakafiri kuwera na vintu vivuwa, hakatoli shoseri shakafira kaweri nashi.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Vinu kwahera shoseri shasishigala sha kutola yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">su, ulunda wakuyi hawusoki upeleru.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Mumpatiru zakuyi zivuwa hakapati ntabiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">madoda hagampati kwa makakala goseri.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Gumleki kaliyi ntambu yakafira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">kumbiti Mlungu hakamjegeri nkalaliru yakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">imnyililikiri gambira shiboga shakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Pamonga hakashapili ligumba lya shuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">kumbiti hakasomwi na msali gwa shaba.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Msali hagusomolwi kulawa munshimba yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">kusongoka kwakuyi hakuwusiwi kumgongu gwakuyi pakung'ereng'eta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">vitiliziya vya kuhowa havimkankali.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Hanja zyakuyi hazihalibisiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">Mlungu hakalagaliri motu gumlunguziyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">shoseri shashisigaliti ukaya kwakuyi hashilunguziwi.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Mpindi hazilangaziyi ukontola wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">pasipanu hapalawiri ukapitawu kwa yomberi.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Lunda zakuyi hazitolwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">mulishaka lya maya ga Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Ashi ndo Mlungu shakampangiliti muntu mkontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">na awu ndo uhala yawulawiti kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwakula Sofari</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kankula.<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />Mpikaniri weri vyaniwagambira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">na panu hamuweri watanga kwaneni<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Muhepeleri, naneni hantakuli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">na pantakula kala mwendereyi kumbeziya.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Nimlalamikirandiri muntu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Toziya nana shintu shashintenda nyamali.<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Mndoli, namwenga hamulikangashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">na ali haliwatendi mnyamali.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Panilihola yagampatiti ntira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">na nshimba yangu yankulendemera kwa lyoga.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Ntambu gaa wakontola wankali wakulikala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">Hashi makakala gawu gongereka mpaka muwuzewi?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Wawawona wana wawu pawawera na wazukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">na wiwuka wawu pawakula.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Kwa womberi kila shintu sha ponga pota lyoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">Mlungu pota kawakomangi.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Wang'ombi wawu woseri wongereka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">walela pota ntabiku yoseri.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Wana wawu washinigashiniga gambira shipinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">na wana wawu wavina msambu,<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Wimba agawu pawagomba ngoma na vingutinguti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">na kusekelera lizyiwu lya filimbi.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Wantu wakontola wawera na ponga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">wahowa pota kutabika.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Wamgambira Mlungu nagutushenyiya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">Tufirandiri kuvimana shagufira gwenga.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Mlungu Yakana makakala ndo gaa ata tumtenderi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Twankupata shishi patumluwa?<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Womberi walihola kuwera na mpatiru kulawilana na weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">kumbiti neni napamuherandiri na womberi.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Hashi mara ninga guwona ga wakontola wakala makaliru matali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Guwona koo Mlungu kawalaga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Ama kawagamiziya kwa maya gakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Ata hangu wagulusiwi gambira mihamba miyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">waweri gambira miwawi yayitolwa na lyega!<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Mwenga mtakula, Mlungu kawatulira wana wawu makomangu ga wantu wakontola awa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Kumbiti neni ntakula Mlungu kawawuziliri wantu weni, su wapati kuvimana!<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Wakontola wawoni weni pawagamira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">guwaleki waoni weni nkalaliru ya Mlungu Yakana Makakala.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Mana wakontola pawahowa hapawalisheri shanashiwapati wiwuka wawu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">Mashaka gawu pagasoka upeleru.<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Hashi, muntu kaweza kumfunda Mlungu umani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">Mlungu mweni hakawatozi yawalikala pasipanu?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Muntu kahowa pakawera na makakala gakuyi goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">pakawera na manemu na ponga,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />kamema lipaki nduu munshimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">na mihonju yakuyi payiwera yankali makakala.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Yumonga kahowa na hinginiku nentu mumoyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">pakawera kenilawaliri shoseri shiherepa.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Hangu, woseri wahowa na kufintirwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">woseri wagipikirwa na wampekenyi.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Mpikaniri! Neni nigamana maholu genu goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">na mipangu yenu yankumbeziya.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Pa mkosiya, ya koshi numba ya mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Yakoshi numba yakalikaliti mkontola?<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Kumbiti memuwakosiyi yawapita njira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">na memfiruwi kuwapikanira mirandu yawatakula.<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Hashi mkontola kawusiwa su mahalibisiya nagampata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">na kaponiziwa lishaka lya nkalaliru!<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Gaa yakafira kutakula madoda ga muntu mkontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">ama yakamwuzilira kwa goseri gakagatenditi?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Pakatolwa kujegwa mulisembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">wantu hawatulwi waliloleri lisembi lyakuyi<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Wantu wavuwa wamfata kumbeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">na wamonga wavuwa wamlongolera pakafintirwa, litapaka lisulusiwa pampindi pakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Muweza hashi mwenga, kunkolamawoku kwa uzigizgi wenu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">Mawankulu genu gahera shoseri ila mpayu.<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi kamwankula kayi Ayubu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOB 22:1-27:23">22:1-27:23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Shakapanu, Elifazi muntu gwa Temani, kamwankula Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />Kwahera shintu shoseri muntu kaweza kumtanga Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Ata yakana luhala kawezandiri kumtanga Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Hashi, gulihola gumsekeziya Mlungu toziya gwahera madoda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Ama kapata mota gaa handa gwahera likosa?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Su gulihola Mlungu kankukukoma na kukutoza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">toziya gwenga gumpanana ligoya?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Ndala! Ukontola wa gwenga ndo mkulu nentu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">Udoda waku wahera mpeleru!<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Gwenga gumpoka mlongu gwaku nguwu yakatuliti poni, gumtoliliti nguwu yimu ayi yakaweriti nayi.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Guwawima mashi walii yawaweriti watoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">guwawima shiboga walii yawaweriti na njala.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Gwenga ndo muntu yagwana makakala, na litapaka lyoseri lyaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">wantu wankutira. Litapaka ali likupanana makaliru gaherepa.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Guwatangandiri wakenja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">na kuwawonera washiwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Ndo mana gwana ntabiku zivuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">na ndo mana gwankulendemera kwa lyoga.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Luwindu likugibikira naguwona shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">malawa ga mashi gakugibikira.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Hashi Mlungu kakumpindi za kumpindindiri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Kumpindi kuliku ntondu yaziwera kumpindi nentu!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Kumbiti gwenga gutakula, Mlungu kavimana shishi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Hashi, yomberi kaweza kutoza mmawundi?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Mawundi gazotopa gamzyengeta nakatulola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">yomberi ntambu yakagendagenda kunja mulyera lya pasipanu!<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Hashi, gwamuwa kufata njira za makashu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">zyeni wantu wadoda wazifata?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Wantu woseri wahowiti pamberi pa mashaka gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">malawa gawajega kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">Na waheriti pahala pa kulikala<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Womberi wamgambira Mlungu, gutuleki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">Mlungu Yagwana Makakala guweza kututenda shishi?<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Kumbiti Mlungu ndo yakamemiziyiti numba zawu vintu vivuwa viherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">kumbiti womberi wamtuliti kutali na maholu gawu!<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Wantu wa Mlungu pawagawona aga waseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">na wantu yawahera madoda wawaseka na wawabeziya,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />walonga nakaka wankondu watwenga walagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">na shashisigaliti shilunguziwa motu.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Su vinu Ayubu, gumjimiri Mlungu su guweri na ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">na panu mirandu iherepa hayikwiziri.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Gwanki mafundu kulawa kwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">na guvituli visoweru vyakuyi mumoyu gwaku.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Pagumuwuyira Mlungu mirandu yaku hayigendi weri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">paguwusiya ukontola kutali na ukaya kwaku,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />pagwasira kutali lunda yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">na zahabu ya Ofiri guyiyasiri kutali,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Gumtendi Mlungu yakana makakala kawera ndo zahabu yaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">na feza yaku ya mana,<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />ndo hagumnemeleri Mlungu yakana makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">na gumtumbiri yomberi.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Hagumluwi na yomberi hakakupikaniri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">gwenga hagutendi galii gagutakuliti kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Shirii shagufira kutenda hashitendeki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">na kulangala hakukuwaliri njira zaku.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Mana, Mlungu kawasulusiya woseri yawalitumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">kumbiti kawalopola yawananaga.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Mlungu kamlopola muntu yakahera likosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">gwenga hagulopolwi kwa matendu gaku gaherepa.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kamwankula kayi Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kankula.<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />Leru viraa lilalamiku lyangu ndo likalipa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">Mpata utama na kukwinkinika toziya Mlungu kendeleya kunkomanga na kuntenda ntabiki.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Menivimani pahala pakumpata Mlungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">Mewezi kugenda pakwegera na yomberi.<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Menjegi visoweru vyangu kulongolu kwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">na kumgambira kila shintu yashiwera mumoyu gwangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Mewezi kuvimana shakafira kunankula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">na kuvimana shakafira kung'ambira.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Hashi, Mlungu mekasingani na neni kwa makakala gakuyi goseri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Nakaka, mekampikaniri.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Yomberi kaweza kuyowera na muntu mwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">Mlungu mtoza gwangu mekamuwi handa nahera makosa mashaka goseri.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Guloli, ng'enda kwagulawa mshenji, kumbiti nimpatandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">mbuya kwaguzyeta mshenji, kumbiti nsinda kumwona.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Nimsakula uwega wa kushana kumbiti nimwonandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">ng'alambukira kusika viraa, kumbiti nimwonitindiri.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Kumbiti yomberi kavimana kwang'endera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">pakamalira kunankula haweri herepa gambira zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Nfata lwayu lwakuyi kwa waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">njira yakuyi niyikolera pota kugalambuka.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Ndekandiri kuzikola lagiru zyakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">ila nivifira visoweru vyakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Kumbiti yomberi kagalambukandiri, gaa yakaweza kumgalambula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">Lyakalifira, ndo lyakalitenda!<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Hakamaniziyi goseri gakampangiriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">na gavuwa gambira aga ga mumahala mwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Hangu, nendemera kwa lyoga kulongolu kwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">ata paniliholera goseri aga neni nana lyoga.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Mlungu kagutenda moyu gwangu guperuwi makakala kwa kutira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Mlungu yakana makakala kantulira lyoga. <verse eid="JOB 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Toziya ya ntabiku yangu yoseri, niliwona kuwera namuluwindu dunyu, luwindu luwoneka kunkubikira neni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">Kumbiti hapenintiri kuyowera.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Ntambu gaa Mlungu Yakana Makakala katulandiri shipindi sha kutoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">ntambu gaa yawamumana washimanandiri shipindi shakuyi ashi?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Wantu wawusiya vimaniziwu vya mbaka za malambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">na wamonga wiwa mifugu na kuyifyota.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Wawapokanga washiwa punda wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">wamtula poni ngo'mbi gwa mkenja.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Wawalewelera wahushu nawapata vyawafira kupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">wawatenda wahushu wawatugi.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Hangu wahushu wawera handa punda gwa kuntundu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">wahushu wasakula kuntundu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">su wapati shoseri sha kuwafyota wana wawu.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Wahushu wankulisolera masigala ga mabenangu mumalambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">wankusola mumalambu ga mizabibu ya wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Pashiru poseri kagonja shivula pota nguwu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">shaaka sha mpepu wahera sha kuligipikira.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Walowa kwa mvula ya kumigongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">walififa mumatalabuwi nawalowa.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Wakontola wiwa wanonu mumaweri ga mawu gwawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">Wamonga wawatula muuwandana wana wa wahushu.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Wana awa watendwa wagendi pota nguwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">pawapapa nganu agawu pawawera na njala,<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />pawawanyawira lipaki lyawu lya mzayituni wakontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">ama kukama divayi pota kuyisumata.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Kulawa kumjini kulira kwa yawahowiti kupikinika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">na yawatenduwitwi wabotanga kuluwa utanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">kumbiti Mlungu kapikanirandiri nakamu luwa zawu.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Kwana wamonga wakontola yawafirandiri kulangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">yawazimanandiri njira za kulangala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">na wafirandiri kuzifata njira zakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Yakalaga kimuka mandawira putiputi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">su kugenda kuwalaga wahushu na yawahera shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">na pashiru papiza, lihengu lyakuyi ndo kwiwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Mhumba kahepera luwindu lwingiri, pakalonga kwahera yanakamoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">shakapanu kafifa sheni shakuyi kwa nguwu.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Pashiru wantu wabomola numba, su wiwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">kumbiti paluwala walitatila mnumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">na wafirandiri wawoneki mukulangala.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Kwa womberi luwindu tototu ndo mandawira yawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">na luwindu ndo ganja gwawu.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />Kumbiti mtakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">wakontola watolwa kalongola na malawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">pahala pawu pakulikala pasigala kuwera isi ipangirwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">kwa hera yakagenda kumalambu gawu ga mizabibu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Handa seluji ntambu yayimung'unyuka mu livuki na mushipindi sha kuyuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">ndo isi yawalikala wantu yawahowiti ntambu yayiwanyasula wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Toziya mlera gwawu kawalwaluwa wantu awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">wantu wakontola hapeniwaholwi kayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">Hangu ndo ntambu yawamegwa gambira mtera.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Wakontola wawapunja wadala yawahera wana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">Pota kuwatendera maheri wadala wakenja.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Mlungu, kwa makakala gakuyi kawagamiziya wana uwezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">Mlungu pakawakomanga womberi watwezuka na kuhowa.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Kawaleka wakontola waliwoni wana ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">kumbiti masu gakuyi galolalola migenderanu yawu.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Wakontola wanampatiru shaka shifupi hera, shakapanu wagamira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">wayuma na kuwera tifutifu handa lihambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">walumbatulirwa kutali gambira mikunguwi ya nganu.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Gaa, yakaweza kutakula kuwera neni shantakula shanakakandiri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">na kulangaziya kuwera visoweru vyangu vyanakakandiri?<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Bildadi kamwakula kayi Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Shakapanu Bilidadi, muntu gwa kulawa Shuhi, kankula.<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />Mlungu ndo yakana uwezu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">wantu woseri wamguwiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">Yomberi katula ponga mpaka kumpindi kwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Gaa yakaweza kuwalanga mashonta gakuyi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Gaa yakamulikirwandiri na lulangala lyakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Muntu kaweza hashi, kutenda yagamfiriziya Mlungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Ama muntu kaweza hashi kuwera kaherepa?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Kwa Mlungu ata lyezi ling'eleng'etandiri nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">viraa ndondu ziherepandiri kulongolu kwakuyi Mlungu,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />ntambu gaa vinu muntu mweni ndo shigongolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">muntu mweni ndo shikwitakwita hera!<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwankula kayi Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kankula.<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />Ntambu gaa gumtangiti yakahera uwezu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">Ntambu gaa gumlopoliti yakahera makakala!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Gumgambiriti shishi yakahera na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">na kumaniziya umani waku!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Kumbiti gutakula aga toziya ya gaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Gaa yakakutenditi kutakula hangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Ndo uwezu wa Mlungu<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kankwankula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Yawahowiti wa pasi aku wankulendemera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">mashi ga pasi na yawalikala aku gawatira.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Isi ya wantu yawahowiti yamwaziwu kulongolu kwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">Pahala padoda pagibikirwa ndiri.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Mlungu kazalira kushana pahala yapahera shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">na kayalika pasipanu pahala yapahera shintu,<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />kagatawa mashi kumawundi gaweri gazotopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">na mawundi gapantikandiri kwa uzotopa wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Kagibikira sheni sha lyezi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">na kuyalika pampindi pakuyi kwa liwundi.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Katula mpaka pakati ya bahari ma mpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">mumpaka pakati pa paluwala na pashiru.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Mlungu pakalaviya liziwu lya kukalapira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">mpanda za mpindi zilendemera na kulikangasha.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Kwa makakala gakuyi kanyamaziyiti bahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">kwa umani wakuyi kamwangamiziyiti njoka gwa bahari yawamshema Rahabu<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Kwa mpumula yakuyi kagululiti lyera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">kwa liwoku lyakuyi kamlagiti njoka yakaguluka.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Aga ndo madidini hera mumatendu gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">ndo madidi hera gatupikanira kwa yomberi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Gaa yakaweza kuvimana ukulu wa makakala gakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumwankula Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ayubu kendereya kutakula, <verse eid="JOB 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />nilirapa kwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">yakambusiliriti mirandu yayiweriti gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Mlungu Yakana Makakala yakantenditi neni weri na utama<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />Ntambu yanendeleya kulikala,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 27:3">na rohu ya Mlungu payendeleya kuwera mngati mwangu,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />neni hapeni ntakuli mpayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">pota kuwazyanga wantu.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Mbezandiri kutakula gambira mwenga mzumba nakaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">mpaka kuhowa kwaneni ntakula nahera likosa.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Hapeni ndeki kutakula nahera makosa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">Mumoyu gwangu kwahera sha kuntoza.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Mnkondu gwangu kapati azabu ya mkontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">yakagoloka kundawumu kakomangwi gambira mdoda.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Muntu yakampananandiri ligoya Mlungu kana litumbiru gaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">Mlungu pakamwusiya mkontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">na pakamwusilira ukomu wakuyi kana litumbiru gaa?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Hashi, pakapatwa na ntabika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">Mlungu hakapikaniri kulira kwakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Mkontola hapeni kanemeleri kulongolu kwa Mlungu yakana makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">hapakawezi kwendeleya kumluwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Haniwafundi uwezu wa Mlungu ntambu yawuwera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">hapeniniwafifi mipangu yakuyi Mlungu Yakana Likakala.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Kumbiti mwenga muvinamana weri mlandu agu muliwona ali maweni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">Hashi, mtakula visoweru vyaviwerandiri na mana?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sofari kankumwankula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Ashi ndo Mlungu shakamtuliliti muntu mkontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">shawampangiriti muntu yakawonera wantu ndo ashi.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Ata wana wakuyi wapalu pawawera wavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">kumbiti hawalagwi kunkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">wiwuka wakuyi hapeni waweri na shiboga shivuwa.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Walii yanawaponeka kunkondu, hawahowi kwa malweri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">na wakenja wawu hapeni wawaliliri.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Ata pakamamatira mpiya gambira lidikudiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">na nguwu zivuwa ata wasindi kuvala,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />hakamamatili hera, kumbiti muntu yakamfiriziya Mlungu ndo hakazivali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">na mpiya zakuyi hawabagulani wantu yawahera likosa.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Numba yakayinyawa mkontola ndo gambira ubunta wa buyibuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">ndo gambira shisasa sha mlolera kulirambu.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Kagonja pakawera mlunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">shaka pakavugula masu gakuyi ulunda wakuyi wagamira.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Vitiliziya vimkangala gambira malawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">pashiru kapatwa na shimbunga.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Lyega lya kwagulawira mshenji limugulusiya kagamira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">lifyagilira kutali kulawa pakalikala.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Lyega ali limkankala pota lusungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">hakajeri kutuga kumbiti mbiru za hera.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Lyega limbolera pakatuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">na kumdokola kulawa pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankuluzyumira Luhala lwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Nakaka kwana mabawiru ga mabuhi ga feza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">na pahala pa kugulula zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Wantu wabawa shuma mulitapaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">na shaba ilumbuziwa kulawa mumabuhi ga shaba.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Wabawa migodi wajega lumiliku muluwindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">walolalola utali wa litapaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">na kubawa mabuhi yagana madini muluwindu.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Muntu kabawa malindi kutali na pawalikala wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">patali na wantu na pahala yapafikikandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">wabawa madini watyeta pawatawalirwa ngoyi.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Kulawa mulitapaka shiboga shiwoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">kumbiti pasi pakuyi kila shintu wapantanga mabuhi kwa motu.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Mumabuwi gakuyi kwana mabuhi ga beyi nkulu ga rangi ya buluu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">na litapaka lyakuyi lyana livu lya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Njira za kugenda kumigodi ayi kwahera mpongu yakaliya nyama yakayimana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">pota lisu lya kapungu halyeni woni njira ayi.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Wankanyama wa kuntundu wenezitimbi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">pota simba hawenizipiti.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Wantu wabawanga matalabuwi makamala nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">wayibawa migongu na kuyiwusilira kutali.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Wapanta shemba pakati pa mabuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">na lisu lyakuyi lilola mabuhi ga beyi nkulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Kadiwa mbwiru nazinyililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">na kulaviya vintu vyavilififiti.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Kumbiti luhala halupatikani koshi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Na pahala gaa yapapatikana umani?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Kwahera muntu yakamana ukulu wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">pota luhala lupatikanindiri muisi ya wantu yawawera wakomu.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Pahala pa mashi matali patakula, kwahera luhala kwatwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">na bahali itakula, kwatwenga kwahera viraa.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Luhala luwezandiri kupatikana kwa zahabu iherepa pota kwa kupima mabuwi ga feza zivuwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Hapeni iwezi kupimirwa kwa zahabu yayilawa Ofiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">pota kwa mabuwi ga beyi nkulu ga Saridoniki ama ga rangi ya samawiti,<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Zahabu ama shiyowu vilinganilindiri navi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">Pota kugalambulwa na mabuwi ga zahabu iherepa.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Luhala lwana mana kuliku mabuwi ga yagashemwa tumbawe na rubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">beyi yakuyi nkulu kuliku beyi ya lulu,<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Mabuwi ga Topazi yagalawa kushi yayishemwa Esiyopiya hapeni iwezi kulifana nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">pota kuweza kupananwa beyi ya zahabu iherepa.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Su, luhala lulawa koshi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Na umani uwoneka koshi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Luhala lulififa mumasu mwa viwumbi vyoseri vikomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">na wampongu wa kulyera hapeni wawezi kuyiwona. <verse eid="JOB 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Uhalibisiya na kuhowa vitakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">tupikanira mininitira.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Mlungu ndo kayimana njira ya luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">kavimana pahala palupatikana.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Toziya yomberi kawona mpaka upeleru wa pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">kawona kila shintu pasi pampindi,<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />pakalipananiti liyega makakala gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">na kugapimira mashi mbaka zyakuyi,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />na kalagalira mvula itowi koshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">lumeta na mpanta vipiti koshi,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />panu ndo pakawoniti mana ya luhala na kulubwera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">kalukagula na kulujimira na kuwona lufaa.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Shakapanu Mlungu kamgambira muntu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">Guloli! Kumpanana ligoya Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mwanjiru gwa luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">Na kulitula kutali na ukontola ndo umani.<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kankumalira matakulu gakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Su Ayubu kanja kutakula kayi. <verse eid="JOB 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />Meweri gambira makashu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">shaka shilii sheni Mlungu pakandoliti,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />mashaka goseri Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">na kawera lulangala pang'endangenda muluwindu.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Ashi shiweriti shaka sha mpatiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">Mlungu ndo ganja gwangu na kalolera numba yangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Mlungu Yakana Makakala kaweriti pamuhera na neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">na wana waneni waweriti pakwegera na neni.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Shaka ashi ngombi na wambuzi waneni walaviyiti maweli mavuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">na mizeyituni yaneni ilaviya lipaki.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Pang'enditi kuligomi lya mji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">na kulivaga pamuhera na wazewi wa mji,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />wantemba pawamoniti wagolokiti pampeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">na wazewi yawalivagiti, wagolokiti kwa ligoya.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Wakulu pawamoniti walekiti kuyowera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">watula shala pamlomu kuwagambira wantu walikali jii,<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Yawamanikaniti nentu wanyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">na miromu yawu itatwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Kila yakapikaniriti visoweru vyangu kanfiliriti maheri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">na pakamoniti, kajimiriti visoweru avi handa vya nakaka.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Toziya nimlopoliti mhushu yakanduwiti utanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">viravirii na mshiwa yakawerandiri na gwa kumtanga.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Wantu yawaweriti sambira kuhowa wazyumiti mana niwatangiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">niwatenditi wakenja wawoni kayi nemeru mumoyu.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Mashaka goseri kutenda yagafiruwa ndo gambira nguwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">na kutenda yagaminika ndo gambira lihabiti na lijenjeri.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Kwa wanalwisi weriti masu gakuwalanguziya njira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">kwa vibyeketu weriti mtanga gwawu.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Kwa wahushu weriti tati gwawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">niwatetiyiti wantu kwaugangamala kuteteya maheri ga wantu yaniwamanitindiri.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Halibisiya makakala ga wantu wakontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">niwatenda wawalekiziyi malopola wawu.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Mashaka gangu ga kulikala hagongereki gambira muhanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">shakapanu niliholiti kuwera hahoweri munumba yangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Neni gambira mtera yaguyalikiti mishigira mumashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">na pashiru mangami galoviya ntambi zyakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Uweru wangu hawuweri syayi kwaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">na makakala gangu gapungulwandiri.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Shaka ashi wantu wampikiniriti kwa litumbiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">walikala jii kuhepera shantakula.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Pamaliriti kutakula waheriti shakongera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">wapikaniliti kila shisoweru shantakuliti na kushiholera.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Wantu wahepeleriti neni gambira yawahepera mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">waweriti gambira wantu yawaheperiti shaka mvula ya kuyalira.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Pawatwezikiti niwatenditi waweri na nemeru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">ulangala wa sheni shangu uwatenda wanemeleri.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Niwalongoleriti kwa kuwalogoziya njira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">Weriti kwawu gambira mfalumi pakati pa mashonta gakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">Gambira mtu yakawazyangazyanga wantu yawadaya.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Kumbiti vinu wantu wankuseka, wantu yawaweriti wapusu kuliku neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">wantu weni watati wawu niwawoniti wafaandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">ata kuwalola wang'ang'a waneni yawalolera kondolu waneni.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Mempati shishi kulawa kwa womberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">wantu weni makakala gawu gaweriti gawapelera.<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Waweriti wahushu nentu toziya waweriti wananjala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">wasakuliti shiboga kushiwala pashiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">wasakuliti kuliya ata mishigira pahala papawerandiri na wantu. <verse eid="JOB 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Wapiti mihambi kulidowi waliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">waliyiti ata mishigira ya mtera.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Wawingitwi kutali na wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">wantu wawabotera gambira wavimbegu.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Su wafiritwi kusakula uponeru munshemba za mashi mumpanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">kumalindi mlitapaka na mumatalabuwi.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Kuntundu aku waliliti gambira wankanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">wajojonikiti pamuhera pasi kushisaka.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Waweriti wazigizigi nentu na yawabeziwitwi nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">wantu wawawingira kutali na muisi yawu,<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Su vinu wana wawu wankunseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">na wankunjongera neni.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Wankalalira na kushapira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">pawamona neni wantemera mata kusheni.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Toziya Mlungu kampusilira makakala na kunsoniziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">wawera lekeru kuntendera ntambu yawafira.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Shipinga sha wantu shigoloka kunsitaki pashisakula kunkusiya kwa kunyambira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">shinkomanga su kunaga.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Watu awa wadiwa njira yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">wongera maya ga neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">na kwahera muntu gwa kuwalewelera.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Wanizira kila uwega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">na kunkopokera shaka paweriti pasi su wantagi,<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Nkolitwi na lyoga nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">ligoya lyangu liwusiwa gambira lyega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">gampatiti galii gawusiwitwi gambira liwundi.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />Vinu nivimana kuwera sambira nankuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">mashaka goseri ntabika.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Pashiru mihonju yaneni yoseri intama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">utama yawumemena upolandiri.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Kwa makakala gakuyi Mlungu kawera gambira nguwu kwaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">kantawira gambira ukosi wa nguwu yangu musingu.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Kanasira mulidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">wera gambira livu na lidikudiku.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Nikulilira, kumbiti gunankulandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">na nikuluwa kumbiti gumpikanirandiri.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Gwenga gugalambuka kuwera mnkesera kwa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">guntabisiya kwa liwoku lyaku lyana makakala.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Gunasira muliyega na kunkulusiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">gunasa aku na aku mumakupala nentu.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Nakaka! Nivimana hagunjegi mukuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">pahala pawanaliwoni woseri yawawera wakomu.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Payiwera muntu kawera muntabiku kaluwandiri utanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">na ndililiti utanga mushiwembu shakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Hashi, niwaliliritindiri yawaweriti na ntabiku?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">Ama monitindiri kutama toziya ya wahushu?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Kumbiti pahepeliti maheri, madoda gampatiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">pandoliti lulangara luwindu linizira<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />moyu gwangu gushashatika pota kunyamalira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">mashaka ga ntabika gampata.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Ulweli utenda likuli lyangu liweri lititu ila kwa kungulandiri kwa mshenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">ngoloka paweru kuluwa utanga.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Ndira gambira shibweta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">na ganja gwa lisisigira.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Lukuli lwangu luwambuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">mihonju yagu ilwala kwa malweri. <verse eid="JOB 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Lingutinguti lyangu liwera lya kutenda shiwembu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">na mluli gwangu guwera gwa kudayilira.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Nilitawa nakamu namweni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">nagamlola mhinga kwa matamata.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Mlungu Yakana Makakala kawatoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">wantu yawatenda hangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Kagalagalira malaguwa kwa wantu yawatenda ukontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">na kuwatoza wantu yawatenda madoda. <verse eid="JOB 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Mlungu kagawona gantenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">na kugawona makaliru ga nkala.<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Payiwera nilikala kwa kufata mpayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">na kugenda kuwapayira wantu,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />nimluwa Mlungu katakuli kuwera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">neni nahera likosa.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Payiwera nilikandiri ntambu yayifiruwa ama moyu gwangu gufwata matamata ga nshimba yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">ama mawoku gangu gadodisiwa na vidoda,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />su shayaliti kaliyi muntu yumonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">viboga vyangu mlirambu vitupulwi.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Payiwera neni nanamatamata kwa mdala gwa muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">ama kumgwadira gwapakwegera gwangu,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />su, mdala gwangu kamtelekeri shiboga mpalu yumonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">ama wapalu wamonga wagonji nayu.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Mlandu agu ndo likosa likulu na lyakukalaziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">ukontola weni ufiruwa kutozwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Likosa lyangu liwera gambira motu gwa kununguziya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">na kunagamiziya, na kulunguziya nakamu vintu vyangu vyoseri.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Payiwera niwapananandiri shilii shawafiruwiti wantumintumi wangu wadala na wapalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">pawanjegiriti malalamiku gawu,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />hantendi shishi Mlungu pakaliwona na neni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Pakanolanola hanimwankuli shishi?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Mana Mlungu ndo yakamumbiti neni na ntumintumi gwangu, yomberi ndo yakatuwumbiti twawoseri twenga.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Payiwera niwawima shawafira wahushu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">ama kugaleka masu ga wakenja gasindi kulola,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Ama ndiya shiboga shangu ulanamweni, pota kuwatanga washiwa shoseri?<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Kumbiti! Kwanjira untemba waneni wera mlera gwawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">kwanjira uwana wangu niwalongoziya wakenja.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Hashi, nimwoniti muntu kuhowa kwa kukosa nguwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">ama mhushu yakahera nguwu ya kuvala,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />nimpananiti livuki kwa kumvalisiya nguwu ya mibahira ya kondolu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">Na yomberi kantekelera.<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Kwakuwatanga washiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">hampendelewi kumahakama,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />Mlungu na kankomangi neni payiwera mirandu ayi yanakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">na hanjimili nkomangu ayi.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Toziya ntira kukomangwa na Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">wezandiri kusegelera ukulu wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Litumbiru lyangu nilitula muzahabu, ama niyigambira zahabu iherepa, Gwenga ndo uponera wa neni.<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Hashi menemeleli uvuwa wa ulunda wangu, ama, kulitumba vyampatiti vya mawoku gangu?<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Handa nguwiliti mshenji paguwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">na lyezi palipata muherepa wakuyi,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />na moyu gwangu gujerwa su kuviguwira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">naneni niganonera mawoku gangu kwa ligoya,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />viraa awu mewuweri ukontola wa wakwazibiwa na watoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">mana meweri udoda kulongolu kwa Mlungu yakawera kumpindi.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Hashi nsekelela kwagamira kwa mnkondu gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">ama kusekelera pakapatitwi na magamiziya?<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Ndala! Nimtakulindiri muntu yoseri madoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">kwa kumpangira su kahowi.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Wantumintumi wangu woseri watakula pota kufifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">kila mhenga kashemerwa ukaya kwaneni.<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Yakawera na mwanja kagonjandiri kunja munumba yaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">niwalekandiri wagonji kunja.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Nfifa makosa gangu gambira wamonga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">Nema kujimira vidoda vyangu?<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Ntirindiri kugoloka kulongolu kwa shipinga sha wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">pota kunyamala ama kulitatira mnumba kati, kwa kutiliziwa na beziya zawu.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Meyiweri mbaka kuweri na muntu gwa kumpikanira!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Nililapa kila shantakuliti shanakaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Nimgambira Mlungu Yakana Makakala kanankuli!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Pamonga masitaka gawandavilira wankondu waneni megalembwi!<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Menigavali kwa malingu mumawega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">na kulivalisiya kumtuwi gambira lijenjeri.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Menimwalangiri Mlungu kila shintu shantenditi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">menimgenderi gambira mwana gwa mfalumi.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Payiwera niwa litapaka lyanililima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">lilambu melinsitaki payiwera ntenda hangu,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />Payiwera ndiya viboga pota kulipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">ama kuwalaga wenikaya,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />su misontu imeri pa nganu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">na magugu pa shayiri.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">Matakulu ga upeleru ga Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kankumgambira Ayubu hangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1-37:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Wantu watatu awa. Elifazi na Bilidadi na Sofari, walekiti kumwankula toziya Ayubu kaliwoniti kuwera muheri.<verse eid="JOB 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Hangu Elihu mwana gwa Barakeli kulawa likabila lya Buzi muntu gwa lukolu lwa Rama kakalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:2">Kamkalaliriti Ayubu toziya Ayubu kaliwoniti mwaminika pa Mlungu kumwalangila kuwera kaminika.<verse eid="JOB 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Viraa, kawakalaliriti waganja watatu wa Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:3">toziya wawerindiri na shakumwankula Ayubu na hangu iranguziya kuwera Mlungu kanalikosa.<verse eid="JOB 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Elihu kaweriti kanyamala shaka wazewi awa pawatakuliti na Ayubu, toziya yomberi kaweriti mntemba kuliku womberi. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Kumbiti pakawoniti wantu watatu awa wasinditi kumwakula Ayubu, kaweriti na maya. <verse eid="JOB 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Su Elihu mwana gwa Barakeli, kulawa likabila la Buzi kanjiti kutakula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">Neni namntemba na mwenga mwawazewi nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">hangu neni ntiriti kuwagambira shaniliholiti.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Ntakuliti mmoyu. Guleki wana mashaka gavuwa watakuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">wana vinja vivuwa wafundi luhala.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Kumbiti rohu ayi yayiwera mngati mwa muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">pumula ya Mlungu yakana likakala ndo imtenda muntu kuvimana.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Kumbiti wazewi ndiri gwaka yawu ndo wana mahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">pota wakulundiri gweka yawu yawamana yaliwera teratera.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Hangu ntakula, mumpikaniri neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">mleki na neni ntakuli shanishimana.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Hangu heperiti shamfiriti kutakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">mpikaniriti matakulu yenu ya luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">pamuweriti mwankusakula visoweru vya kutakula.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Niwapikaniriti weri, kumbiti kwahera yumu gwenu yakamkankiti Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">mwawoseri msinditi kuvyankula visoweru vyakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Namtakula, vinu tupata luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Yakafira kumkanka ndo Mlungu pota muntu ndiri.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Visoweru vya Ayubu viweriti ndiri toziya ya neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">hangu hapeni nimwankuli ntambu yamumwankuliti mwenga.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Mwenga mwana lyoga na mperuwa visoweru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">mwenga mwahera sha kutakula nentu.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Su, heperi hera toziya mtakula ndiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">nilikala hera pota kwankula shintu?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Neni viraa hantaviyi lyankulu lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">naneni hantakuli lyanilimana.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Nanavi visoweru vivuwa nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">rohu yaneni intenda ntakuli.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Moyu gwangu gumema gambira divayi yayidiwitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">gambira mhaku gwa likuli lya divayi yasyayi kala kupantika.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Guleki ntakuli su weri na ponga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">guleki ntakuli.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Hapeni weri muwega wa muntu yoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">pota kutendera visoweru vya kumzyangazyanga muntu.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Neni manandiri kumzyangazyanga muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">hera hangu, Muumba gwangu mekantagi.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Su vinu, Ayubu, gumpikaniri shantakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">gupikanili visoweru vyangu vyoseri.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Vinu hantakuli na gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">nakala kukugambira shilii shawera nashi.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Na muntu muheri, hangu hagujimiri shantakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">hanikugambiri shanishimana kwa waminika.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Rohu ya Mlungu ndo yayiwumbiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">na pumula ya Mlungu Yakana Makakala yimpanana makaliru.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Gunankuli handa guweza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">gupangi visoweru vyaku weri kulongolu kwa neni,<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />gwenga na neni tuwera teratera kulongolu kwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">viraa neni wumbitwi kulawa muutapaka.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Hangu gwahera toziya ya kuntira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">visoweru vyangu vizotopa vikutoperandiri.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Nakaka gutakula, naneni mpikanira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">Mpikinira goseri gagulongiti.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Gwenga gutakula, guherepa na gwahera likosa,<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Gutakula viraa kuwera Mlungu kankukusakulira shidoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">na kukuwona gambira mnkondu gwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Kantawa magulu kwa minyololu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">na kulolalola maleka gaku goseri.<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Kumbiti, nikugambira Ayubu panu gutenda likosa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">Mlungu ndo mkulu kuliku muntu.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Hashi gulikama nayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">hangu pagumkosiya hapenikankuli?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Mlungu patakula katendera njira yimu, ama njira imonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">kumbiti muntu kavimanandiri.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Mlungu kayowera na wantu mukulota na mkuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">shaka mpota zizotopa paziwakangala,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Pawasizira muvitanda mwawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">Panu kawavugulira wantu makutu gawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">kawapapanana lyoga kwa makalipiru gakuyi,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Mlungu kayowera nawa su walekani na matendu gawu madoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">na kuwusilira kutali mtiti gwawu.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Hangu kawatula wantu kutali na kahowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">makaliru gakuyi nagagamira kwa ligumba.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Mlungu kamwazibu muntu kwa utama yawumtenda kagonji mushitanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">utama ukolera viwungilu vyakuyi pota kuleka,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />na yomberi kahera hamu ya kuliya shiboga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">ata shiboga shiherepa kashiwona shimfiliziyandiri.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Nshimba yakuyi yonda pota kumanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">na mifupa yakuyi yayilififiti iwoneka kunja.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Kapagwegera kwingira mulisembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">kuhowa kumwepela.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Kumbiti malayika wa Mlungu pakawera na yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">yumu pakati pa maelufu ga wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu, su kumlangaziya shilii shiheri shakutenda.<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Kamwonera lusungu na kumgambira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">Gumlopoli nakahowa nankugenda pahala pa wantu yawahowiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">panu nanashakutakula toziya yakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Panu nshimba yakuyi iwera gambira mntemba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">hakawezi kuwuyira kayi handa makakala ga untemba.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Shakapanu hakamluwi Mlungu na yomberi hakajimirwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">hakizi kulongolu kwakuyi kwa nemeru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">na Mlungu hakawuzilili nemeru yakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Hakanemeleli kulongolu kwa wantu na kutakula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">Ntenditi vidoda na kupotiziya yashifiruwitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">na neni ntozwandiri kwa aga.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Mlungu kanopoliti nanagamira kulilindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">nsigala mkomu na mona kulangala.<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Guloli Mlungu kamtendera muntu goseri aga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">Kayi mala zivuwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />Kamlopola muntu nakahowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">kampanana lulangala lwa makaliru.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Gupikanili Ayubu, gumpikiniri weri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">gunyamali na neni nikugambili.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Pagwana shakutakula, gunankuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">gutakuli, mana nfira kukuwona gwahera likosa.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Su gunyamali, gumpikaniri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">gulikali jii neni nikufundi luhala.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Shakapanu Elihu kendereya kutakula.<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />Mpikaniri visoweru vyangu, mwenga wantu yamwana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">mpikaniri weri, mwenga yamwana umani.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Gumana unoga wa shiboga pagushilawalira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">su mfiruwa kuvimana weri visoweru vyaneni.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Tulisyaguliri twaweni yagafiruwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">tulijimiri twaweni kwa pamuhera yagawera maheri.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Su Ayubu kalonga. Neni nahera likosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">Mlungu kambusilira shanfiruwitwi kupata.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Tembera nahera likosa moneka kuwera nampayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">ntabika na sambira howa.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Gaa yakawera gambira Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">kwakuyi kubeziya ndo gambira kulanda mashi? <verse eid="JOB 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Kalikola nawatenda makontola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">katyanga na wantu wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Mana katakula, muntu kapatandiri mota yoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">paligaziya kumfiriziya Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />Su mumpikaniri neni, mwenga wantu yamwana umani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Mlungu kawezandiri kutenda ukontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Mlungu Yakana Likakala kaweza ndiri nakamu kutenda likosa.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Mlungu kamwuzilira muntu kulawirana na lyakatenditi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">hakamlipi kulinganira na ntambu yakalikala.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Nakaka, Mlungu katendandiri ukontola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Mlungu Yakana Likakala kagalamburandiri toza yakuyi kwa wantu.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Kwana yoseri yakampanana ukulu pasipanu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Uwezu wakuyi pasipanu ndo wakuyi gweka yakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Handa iwera Mlungu mekaliholeri ulamweni hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">pakawusiya pumula yakuyi pasipanu,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />viwumbi vyoseri mevihowi nakamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">na muntu mekawuyi mulitapaka.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Handa gwana mahala gumpikanili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">Ayubu gupikinili shanikugambira.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Hashi, yakakalalira yaganfiriziya Mlungu kaweza kukolamlima pasipanu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Hashi hagumtozi muntu yakamfiliziya Mlungu na yakana makakala?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Mlungu kamgambira mfalumi, gwenga gudoda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">na wakolamlima, mwenga mwa wakontola!<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Yomberi kalikolandiri na wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">ama walunda kuliku wahushu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">mana woseri awa ndo lihengu lya mawoku gakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Wantu awa wahowa vumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">watikiziwa pashiru na kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">na yawana makakala wawusiwa kutali pota kutendera makakala ga wantu.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Mlungu kalola yawagatenda mashaka goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">yomberi kagawona mirandu yawayitenda.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Kwahera utitu pota luwindu dunyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">weni yawatenda ukontola waweza kulififa.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Mlungu kafirandiri kumgambira muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">shaka sha kumjega su kamtozi.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Kawalaga yawana makakala pota kulolalola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">na kuwatula wamonga pahala pawu.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Toziya kagamana matendu gawu goseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">kawawusiya makakala gawu pashiru na kuwalaga.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Kawakomanga paweru</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:26">toziya ya ukontola wawu,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Toziya waleka kumfata yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">wazisherandiri njira zakuyi zoseri.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Ata kawatenda wahushu wamliri Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">Na yomberi Mlungu kapikanira kulira kwawu yawatabika.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Mlungu pakanyamala, gaa yakaweza kumlawumu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Pakalififa mweni, gaa yakaweza kumwona?<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Katenda hangu, su muntu mdoda nakakolamlima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">ama walii yawajegela wantu ntabiku.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Handa muntu kamgambira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">Nkosa, hapeni ntendi kayi vidoda.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Gunanguziyi makosa ganwezandiri kugawona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">payiwera ntenda madoda, hapeni mbuyiri kayi.<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Hashi, Mlungu hakafiruwi kumkomanga muntu ayu ntambu yagufira gwenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Gwenga ndo yagwamuwa, neni ndiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Su, gutakuli shagulihola gwenga.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Yawana luhala hawajimilani na shantakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">na pawapikanira visoweru vyaneni hawatakuli,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />Ayubu katakula gambira mzigizigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">visoweru vyakuyi vyahera mana.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Ayubu mekalolwilolwi mpaka upeleru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">toziya kankula gambira wantu wakontola.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Kwa vidoda vyaku gongera ugalambuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">na kulongolu kwa woseri twenga gumjongera Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Shakapanu Elihu kendeleya kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />Gulihola mlandu agu gwa teratera?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">Gulonga, neni nahera makosa kulongolu kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Gumkosiya, ndo mota gaa mpata na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">Gupata mota gaa kwa kutendandiri vidoda? <verse eid="JOB 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Hanikwanguli gwenga na waganja waku viraa.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Su guloli kumpindi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">Gugaloli mawundu yagawera kumpindi kuliku gwenga.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Pagutenda vidoda, Mlungu ndo yagumtenda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">Handa pagongera makosa gaku, gulishera gumtenda?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Handa gwenga gwamheri, hashi gumpanana mota.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">Ama yomberi kanka shintu kulawa kwa gwenga?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Ukontola waku hawumtendi muntu handa gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">uheri waku hawumtanki yumonga.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Toziya ya ntabiku ivuwa wantu walira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">waluwa utanga toziya ya makomangu ga wanamakakala.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Kumbiti kwahera yakatakula, kakoshi Mlungu, muwumba gwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">yakantenda weri mkalamka pashiru,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />yakatufunda kuliku wankanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">na kututenda twana luhala kuliku wampongu.<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Wantu awa waluwa utanga kumbiti Mlungu kawankulandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">toziya ya kulitumba kwa twenga wakontola<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Nakaka Mlungu kapikanirandiri kulira kwakuwerandir na mana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">Mlungu Yakana Likakala kalisherandiri kulira aku.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Hakakwankuli hashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">na gwenga gulonga gumwonandiri na toza yaku ya kulongolu kwakuyi na gwenga gumuhepera.<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Viraa gutakula, Mlungu kawakalalirandiri wakontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">pota kuwakomanga wakontola,<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Na Ayubu kendereya kutakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">gongera visoweru pota mahala.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu kendeleya kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />Muheperi shididini, neni hanikulangaziyi shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">mana nanashi sha kutakula shirawa kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Hanjegi luhala lwangu kulawa kutali nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">na kulanguziya kuwera Muwumba gwangu ndo mwaminika<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Nakaka visoweru vyangu vyampayundiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">yakana mahala kapamuhera na gwenga.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Mlungu kana makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">pota kambezandiri muntu yoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">uwezu wa mahala gakuyi ndo mkulu nentu.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Kawalekandiri wakontola wendereyi kulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">kumbiti kawapanana yawapunjwa haki zawu.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Kawalekandiri kuwalolera wantu waminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">na womberi kawatula wakolimlima na kukwiswa,<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Kumbiti handa wantu watawalirwa minyololu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">watenduwa kwa galii gawatenda,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />Mlungu kawalanguziya matendu gawu makontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">na handa womberi ndo wantu yawawera na mtiti.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Kawavugula makutu wapikaniri mafundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">na kawalagalira wawuyi na kuleka ukontola.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Handa pawamjimira Mlungu na kumtendera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">wanampatiru mumashaka gawu goseri, vinja vyawu vyoseri hawaweri na mpatiru.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Kumbiti pawamjimirandiri Mlungu, hawahowi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">na hawahowi pota kuvimana vyaviwera teratera.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Yawamguwirandiri Mlungu wafira kukalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">wamlilirandiri utanga pakawatawa.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Wahowa pawawera wantemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">na upeleru wa makaliru gawu ndo soni.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Kumbiti Mlungu kawalopola yawatabika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">katendela ntabiku yawu kuwafunda su wammani yomberi ndo gaa.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Mlungu kakukwegiti kakulaviya muntabika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">kakutuli pahala pakulu papahera ntabiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">na pameza paku kakutandira viboga viherepa.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Kumbiti vinu gutozwa ntambu yayifiliziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">toza yayifiriziwa ikupata.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Guliloleri, makomangu nayiza kukutenda gujongeri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">ama kulihola uvuwa wa lunda hawukulopoli.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Hashi, ulunga waku hawukutangi muntabiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">ama makakala gaku goseri hagakutangi?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Nagufira nentu pashiru pizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">peni pawatenda wantu wagamiri pawawera.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Guliloleri, naguwugalambukira ukontola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">mana ntabiku ikutura kutali na ukontola.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Guholi ukulu wa makakala ga Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">Gaa yakaweza kumfunda gambira yomberi?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Kwahera yakaweza kumpangira njira yakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">Ama kumgambira Mungu gukoseya.<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Nagulyaluwa kugazyuma matendu gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">geni wantu wagafyapilira.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Wantu woseri wayiwona mirandu yakatenditi Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">wantu wawona matendu gakuyi kulawa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Mlungu ndo mkulu nentu ata tuwezandiri kummana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">mashaka ga makaliru gakuyi galolwalolwandiri.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Yomberi kagatola mashi ga bahari kwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">na kulawa mawundi katenda mandonda ga mvula.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Kagatenda mawundi gatowi mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">na kuwatowera wantu kwa uvuwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Gaa yakavimana mawundi ntambu yagaliyalikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">ama lupanda yaluguguma kuliyera kwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Yomberi kayalika lumeta lwakuyi kuliyera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">na kugagubika matiwa ga bahari luwindu.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Kwa mvula kawaliyiziya wantu na kuwapanana shiboga shivuwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Kabata lumeta kwa mawoku gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">shakapanu kankuguma nawu pahala pakafira,<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Liyega lubwera kwiza kwakuyi Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">ata wankanyama wavimana kuwera kankwiza.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kendereya kutakula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Moyu gwangu gulendemela kulawirana na aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">na kuguluka kulawa pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Mpikaniri kulindimira kwa liziwu lya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">na mwunguurumu gwa liziwu kulawa mumulomu mwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Kalulekaziya luweli pasi pa mpindi yoseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">lumeta lwakuyi lueneya pembi zoseri za pasipanu.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Shakapanu liziwu lyakuyi liguguma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">liziwu lya Mlungu liguguma kwa uweru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">na shaka shoseri ashi lumeta lumetameta.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Mlungu katenda lupanta lya kulikangasha kwa liziwu lyakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">katenda mirandu mikulu yatuwezandiri kuyimana.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Kayigambira seluji, gutuluki pasi pa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">na lufolufolu na mvula, gutowi kwa makakala.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Katata mahengu gakila muntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">su wantu woseri wavimani mahengu gakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Shakapanu wakanyama wawuya mwawalififiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">na wasigala mumpanga zawu.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Lipuga livuma kulawa kwaliyanja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">na mpepu ikalipa kulawa mluhanja lwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Kwa pumula ya Mlungu balafu ilawira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">sheni sha mashi galibata kalongola.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Mlungu kamemiziya mawundi lifolufolu litopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">mawundi gapalasiya lumeta lwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Kwakulagalira kwakuyi mawundi na lupanda vizyengetazyengeta aku na kulii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">katenda kila shintu shakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">shitendeki mupasipanu pa vintu vyakaviwumbiti.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Mlungu katenda mafiru gakuyi pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">gaweri toziya ya kuwakomanga wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">ama kulanguziya ufiru wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Gunyamali Ayubu! Gupikaniri makangashu ga Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Hashi, guvimana Mlungu ntambu yakalagalira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">na kutenda lumeta lwa mawundi lung'eleng'eti?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Hashi, guvimana mawundi ntambu yagayeruka kuliyera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Ndo mahengu ga kukangasha ga ulii yakawera mwaminika gwa umani.<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Shaka liyega lya livuki kulawa kusika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">kwahera luhamba lwankuguluka pampindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">Nshimba yaku yanalivuki nentu kwa nguwu yaguvaliti,<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Hashi, guweza kuziyalika mpindi handa yomberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">ziwera zikamala gambira shiloleru sha shaba shashisugulwa?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Ayubu gutufundi shashifiruwa kumgambira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">mana ntakulu zyetu zalupalaherandiri, twa mluwindu.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Weza hashi kutakula na Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Hashi nimpanani lupenu lya kwagamiziwa<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Vumu wantu wawezandiri kuwona potakufifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">Mshenji gulififa kumberi kumawundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">na lipuga lifyagira liyera.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Mng'eleng'eta guherepa gulawira kushana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">Mlungu kazyengetwa na uweru wa kutiliziya.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Mlungu yakana likakala yatuwezandiri kumsegelera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">uwezu na waminika wakuyi ndo mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">kamema uheri pota kapotuziya haki nakamu.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Su wantu woseri wamtira Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">yomberi kamsherandiri muntu yoseri yakana mtiti.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumwankula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Shakapanu, Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula Ayubu kulawa kulyega lya shivyulavyula.<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />Gaa gwenga yaguvuluvusiya matakula gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">kwa visoweru vyahera mahala?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Gukamali handa mpalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">na neni hanikukosiyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">na gwenga gunankuli.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Guweriti koshi pantuliti miyanjiru ya pasipanu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Gung'ambili, handa gwana umani.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Gaa yakatuliti vipimu vyakuyi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Nakaka gwenga guvimana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Ama gaa yakatalipisiyiti lugoyi pampindi pakuyi kuyipima?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Hashi mpanda za pasipanu zigolosiwa pampindi pa shishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">ama gaa yakatuliti libuwi lyakuyi lya lyanjiru,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />ntondu za mandawira paziweriti zakwimba pamuhera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">na wana wa Mlungu wabotanga kwa kufyapilira?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Gaa yakatatiti malawa ga bahari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">shaka pagalawiti na kuvuma kulawa mmashi matali.<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Neni ndo yang'ibikiti bahali kwa mawundi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">na kuyivilingisiya luwindu luzotopa.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Niyituliriti bahari mbaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">niyidiwira bahari pahala pakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />Niyigambira bahali, upeleru waku ndo panu, nentu ndiri!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">Makupala gaku ga makakala hagapeleri panu.<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Ayubu, kwanjira kwiwuka kwaku gulagaliliti mandawira iyanji?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">Na kulagalila mshenji gulawi,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />guwugambirandiri langala kugibikila pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">na kuwawingira kutali wakontola?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Kulangala pakwiza, wantu wawona pasipanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">mishoru na rangi viwoneka gambira nguwu ya langi.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Kumbiti wakontola hapeni wawuwoni kulangala aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">na wawezandiri kutenda mirandu yawu mikondola.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Hashi, gusoka kumbwiru za bahari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">Ama kugendagenda pampindi pa mashi matali ga bahari?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Hashi, wakulanguziyiti kala migomi ya kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">ama kuyiwona migomi ya kaya ya luwindu dunyu?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Hashi, guvimana ukulu wa pasipanu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">Gung'ambili handa guvimana goseri aga.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Njira ya kusoka ukaya kwa kulangala ndo koshi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">Ukaya kwa luwindu ndo koshi?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Hashi, guweza kuviwuziya ukaya kwakuyi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">Guvimana njira za kusoka ukaya kwakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Gwenga gufiruwa kuvimana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">gwenga gulikariti vinja vivuwa!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Hashi, gwingiliti kala muluhanja lwa balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">ama kuwona luhanja lwa mvula ya mabuwi,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />vyeni nivitula su niviltendeli toziya ya shaka sha ndewu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">toziya ya mashaka ga makomangu ga nkondu?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Yoshi njira ya kugenda pahala lumeta palubagulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">ama aku kwakulawa lyega lya kwagulawa mshenji gupalasiwa pasipanu?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Gaa yakabawiti njira ya mashi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">kuliyera kwajili ya mvula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">Gaa yakalanguziyiti lupanda njira yakuyi kumawundi?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Gaa kayitenda mvula kutowa kulitapaka kwakalikalandiri muntu na shiwala shasha hera muntu?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Mvula itowerwi su isi iyuma na yahera mashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">kuyitenda imeri ntundu.<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Hashi, mvula ina tati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Ama gaa kagalera mandonda ga mangami.<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Balafu ilawa mumtima gwa gaa? Ndo gaa yakaleliti barafu? <verse eid="JOB 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Mbepu yitenda mashi kuwera gakamala gambira libuwi, na sheni sha bahari shilibata.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Guloli vipinga vya ntondu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">Hashi, guweza kuyitawa minyololu ntondu yayishemwa Kilimili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">ama kulegiziya vitawaliru vya ntondu yayishemwa Orioni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Guweza kuzilonguziya ntondu mushaka shakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">ama kumlonguziya kanyama yawamshema Dubu pamuhera na wana wakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Hashi, guvimana lagiru zazikolamlima mpindi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">Guweza kuzipangiya ntambu yakuyi pasipanu?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Hashi, guweza kubota na kugugambira mawundi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">gakugibikiri kwa mnyililiku gwa mvula?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Na kulagalira lumeta lumeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">halukwiziri na kutakula, napanu?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Gaa kampanana muntu luhala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">su kayimani mirandu mumahala gakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Gaa yakana luhala lwa kuweza kuwalanga mawundi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">ama kung'ong'onaziya viwiga vya mashi kumpindi aku?<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Su lidikudiku lya pasipanu lilikolana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">na utapaka ulikolani na kuwera madikudiku?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Hashi, guweza kumwingira simba mawinga gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">ama kumalira hamu ya wana simba,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />pawalififa mumpanga zawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">ama kugonja mwawalififa pawalotera?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Gaa yakawapanana kunguru shiboga shawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">wana wawu pawandilira neni Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">pawaguluka aku na kulii kwa njala?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Hashi guvimana vinjapuli walera shaka gaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">ama guwona kala kulungu pakalera?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Hashi, gumana shaka shakapata yinda kanyama ayu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">Ama gushimana shaka shakuyi sha kulera?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Gushimana shaka shakusuntamala kulera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">ama shaka sha kulera wana wawu?<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Wana wawu wakula kuntundu aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">shakapanu wawaleka wamawu wawu na kugenda zawu.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Gaa yakamlekeziyiti punda gwa kuntundu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Gaa yawayopoliti wagendi kwa wafira?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Neni niwapananiti shiwala shiweri pahala pakulikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">shiwala shana munu kuwera pahala pawu pa pakulika.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Kalitula gweka nakamu na umatu wa miji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">kapikinirandiri umatu wa muntu yakamtendiziya lihengu.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Katyangatyanga kumigongu kupata maliwuziwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">na kusakula shoseri shashiwera shiwisi su kaliyi.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Hashi, mbogu hakajimiri kumtendera lihengu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">Ama hakajimili kugonja mlizizi?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Hashi, guweza kumtawa mbogu lugoyi kulima lirambu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">Ama kukwega ligembi lya kulimira? <verse eid="JOB 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Hashi, hagumtumbiri toziya kana makakala gavuwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">Na kumleka kakutenderi mahengu gaku gazotopa?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Hashi gulihola mbogu kaweza kukujegera mabenu gaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">na kujega viboga pahala pa kukomera?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Mbuni kakomangakomanga mbapatiru zakuyi kwa malingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">kumbiti hapenikawezi kuguluka gambira mzingi.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Mbuni kagaleka maligi gakuyi mulitapaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">su gapati lihemuhemu mumhanga,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Kumbiti kavimanandiri kuwera gaweza kutimbangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">ama kumegangwa na nkanyama gwa kuntundu.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Mbuni kawonera ndiri lusungu wana wakuyi gambira wakuyindiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">ata lihengu lyakuyi palihalibika yomberi kahera lyoga,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Toziya nimtenditi kalyaluwi luhala lwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">pota kumpanana seemu yoseri ya mahala.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Kumbiti pakanja kutuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">kamseka farasi na yakakwena farasi.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Hashi, gwenga Ayubu ndo yagumpananiti farasi makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">ama guwavalasiya mibahira mitalipa musingu zawu?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Hashi, gwenga ndo yagumtenda farasi kaguruki gambira wanjombi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">Mliru gwakuyi ndo gwakulikangasha!<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Kakwandakwanda litapaka kululalanda kalongolakalongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">katugira munkondu kwa makakala gakuyi goseri.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Farasi kaliseka lyoga na katikinyikandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">pota ligumba hapeni limwuziyi kumbeli.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Vintu vya kulikomangira vyawatola wakwena farasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">vilibonda kwa liziwu na kung'ereng'eta kumshenji.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Farasi kendereya kulongolu, pakalendemela kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">lipenga palilira, yomberi kagolokandiri.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Kila paligombwa lipenga, yomberi kalaviya liziwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">kayipikinira nunkila ya nkondu kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">kapikanira nkinta ya wakulu wa mashonta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">Pakawalagalira kwa umatu.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Hashi, shimbowi kalifunda kwagwenga ntambu ya kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">na kutalipisiya mbapatiru zakuyi kugenda kusika?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Hashi, kapungu kaguluka kwa lagalira ya gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">na kunyawa shitukulu shakuyi palugongu?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Kapungu kanyawa pakulikala pampindi pa matalabuwi matali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">na usongoka wa matalawu ndo maboma gakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Kulawa aku kalotera mawinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">masu gakuyi gawona kulawa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Wanawakuyi wayonga mwazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">Palii pashiwera shibudu ndo na ntapu kawera.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kendeleya kumgambira Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />Hashi, gwenga yagulolalola makosa hagulikami na neni Mlungu yakana makakala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Gwenga yagwankulana na neni Mlungu, su gwankuli mirandu ayi!<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Shakapanu Ayubu kamwankula Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />Neni nfaa shintundiri hanikwankuli shishi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">Su nankudiwa mlomu gwangu.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Njeriti kutakula na hapeni ntakuli kayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">Ntakuliti nentu kumbiti hapeni nendereyi kutakula kayi,<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula Ayubu kulawa muupepu wa shivyulavyula.<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />Gukamali gambira gwampalu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">Hanikukosiyi na gwenga hagunankuli.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Hashi, gufira nakaka kuwusiya toza ya neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">gumona nanalikosa su gwenga naguwera na likosa?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Hashi, gwana makakala gambira neni Mlungu gakutenda makulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">Guweza kuyowera kwa liziwu likulu gambira lupanda?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Su, gulilanguziyi kuwera na ligoya na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">gulivalisiyi mweni kwa uweru na ligoya.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Guwawitiri wantu maya gaku makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">gumloli kila yakana mtiti na kumgusiya.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Gumloli yoseri yakana mtiti na gumsulusiyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">guwatimbangi wakontola pahala pawawera.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Guwafindiri woseri pamuhera mulitapaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">guwatawi sheni shawu mulisembi.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Panu hanikumani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">kuwera likakala lyaku gamweni likupanana ukanka.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Gumloli nkanyama mkulu ulii njoka yawamshema Behemoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">yanimwumbiti na nikuwumbiti gwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">ayu kaliya ntundu gambira ng'ombi,<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />guloli makakala yagawera munshimba yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">na gulikangashi ugangamala wa misuli ya mtima gwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Kagutenda mshira gwakuyi gutikinyiki gambira mwerezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">mishipa ya mawondu gakuyi gawera pamuhera.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Mihonju yakuyi gambira mabomba ga shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">viwungu vyakuyi gambira vipandi vya shuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Yomberi ndo muwamu mwa viwumbi vya kulikangasha vya niviumbiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">neni namweni ndo muwumba gwakuyi yaweza kumkanka.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Kumigongu kwana viboga vyawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">na wankanyama woseri wadinga kundundu,<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Kaligonjeka pasi pa viputira vya misontu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">na kulififa pakati pa miteti mumatanda.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Kalififa mlisisi lya viputira vya misontu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">na vya mitera yayimera mumpeku mwa nshemba.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Lushemba palumema katirandiri, yomberi kalilimukandiri kwa lyoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">katirandiri lushemba Yoridani palumema mumlomu.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Gaa yakaweza kumdiwa masu na kulibata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">Gaa yakaweza kumtobola mpula kwa mgomiziwu?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Hashi guweza kumlopola ligongolu ayu yawamshema Lewuyatani kwa ndowana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">Ama kumtawa lulimi wakuyi kwa lugoyi?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Guweza kupitiziya lugoyi mumpula mwakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">ama kudonola lisaya kwa ndowani?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Hashi hakendereyi kuluwa gumwoneri lusungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Ama kayoweri nayu visoweru viheri.<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Hashi hakatendi lipatanu nayomberi su gumtoli kaweri ntumintumi gwakuyi mumakaliru gakuyi goseri?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Hashi guweza kumtawa gambira mbongu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">Ama kumtawa lugoyi kwajiri ya wahinga waku?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Hashi yawashuwuza hawashuwuzi kwa vintu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">Ama kubagula pakati pa yawashuwuza?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Hashi Ayubu guweza kumguma mgoha njoka yawamshema lewowatani mushimba yakuyi na kumlaga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">Ama kumguma msali mumtuwi gwakuyi?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Pagujera kumkola, hapeni gulwaluwi nkondu yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">hapeni gujeri kayi kutenda hangu!<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Payiwera muntu yoseri kana litumbiru lya kumbata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">pakamwona hera, makakala goseri gampelera.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Kwahera shikambaku yoseri yakajera kumwimusiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">ama kwahera yoseri yakaweza kugoloka kulongolu kwakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Mumlomu mwakuyi ilawa milipulipu yayiwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">nzesi za motu ziguruka kunja.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Haniwagambili kuusu magulu gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">na kuwalangaziya ntambu ya makakala na ukulu wakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Gaa yakaweza kumwambula likuli lyakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">ama gaa yakaweza kumsegelera na kumtula lugoyi su kamlongoziyi. <verse eid="JOB 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Kwahera muntu yakajera kumamula mlomu gwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">menu gakuyi gawatenda wantu woseri wamtila.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Magamba gakuyi gawera pamuhera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">gakamala gambira shuma na itikinyikandiri.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Kila limu lyapakwegera na lumonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">hewa iwezandiri kupena pakati pakuyi.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Ziwera pamuhera na zikolanila kila imu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">zilibatilira pamuhera na ziwezandiri kubagulwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Pakatyamula langala ing'eleng'eta, masu gakuyi gambira miyozi ya mshenji gwa mandawila.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Mambamba galawa mumlomu gwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">nsesi za motu zikopoka kunja.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Lyosi lilawa mumpula mwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">gambira kuwala mushiwiga shashipwata mumotu gwa mateti.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Pumla yakuyi iyakiziya makala ga mabuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">na mambamba ga motu galawa mumlomu mwakuyi<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Msingu yakuyi yana makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">wantu watira poseri paligenda.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Minofu ga yanyama yakuyi galikolera pamuhera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">ikamala gambira shuma.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Shifuwa shakuyi shikamala gambira libuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">shikamala gambira libuwi lya kusagira.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Pakagoloka, wana likakala watira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">wana likakala wawuya kumbeli pakanja kugendagenda.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Pagulikoma kwa ligumba hapeni gulitendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">pota mgoha ama msali.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Kwa yomberi shuma ndo gambira luberegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:27">na shaba gambira mtera yaguwoliti.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Kwahera misali yagumtenda katiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:28">ngulungu zyakagumilitwi ziwera gambira miwawi.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Kwa yomberi shindonga ndo gambira shipandi sha lubelegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:29">na wantemba pawamwasira misali mweni kaseka.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Wega wakuyi wa kumtima kwana menumenu na magomboli handa vigayi vya shiwiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">zikwalambula litapaka gambira shipandi sha shuma yashikwegwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Yomberi kagatikisiya mashi matali gambira sufuriya shashipwata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:31">na kukologa bahari gambira shiwiga sha lipaki.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Pakapita kumbeli kwakuyi kaleka njira yaying'eling'eta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:32">muntu mekalisheri mashi matali gana neziwu.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Kwahera shoseri pasipanu shashilifana na yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:33">na katirandiri shoseri.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Kawabeziya wankanya woseri yawalitumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:34">yomberi ndo mfalumi gwa woseri yawanamtiti.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Shakapanu Ayubu kamwankula Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />Nivimana kuwera guweza kila shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">shoseri shagufirakutenda shiwezandiri kulewelerwa.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Gulongiti, gaa ayu yakafifiti matakuziya gangu pota umani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Nakaka ntakuliti mirandu yaniyimanandiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Mirandu ya kulikangasha nentu kwa neni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Yeni nweriti niyimanandiri.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Gulongiti gumpikiniri vinu, na neni hantakuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">hanikukosiyi na gwenga hagunankuli.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Nakaka weriti nikupikanira visoweru vyaku kwa makutu hera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">kumbiti vinu nikulola kwa masu gangu namweni,<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Hangu su noya vidoda pamuhera na kulityelemeka malivu na madikudiku.<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />“Mtuwa Mlungu pakamaliliti kuyowera na Ayubu visoweru avi, kamgambiriti Elifazi, muntu gwa Temani pakalonga, maya gangu gawera kwa gwenga na waganja wawili. Mana myowerandiri nakaka kwaneni, gambira Ayubu ntambu yakalongiti. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Su vinu, mtoli ng'ombi saba na kondolu shipalu saba mumgenderi ntumintumi gwangu Ayubu na mwenga mlaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziwa toziya ya maweni. Ntumintumi gwangu Ayubu hakawaluwili mwenga. Naneni hanigajimili maluwa gakuyi su naniwatendera teratera na uzigizigi wenu. Mwenga mzumbandiri yagawera teratera kwa visoweru vya neni, ntambu yakalongiti ntumintumi gwangu Ayubu.”<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Hangu Elifazi muntu gwa Temani na Bilidadi na Mshuhi na Sofari muntu gwa Naamati, watenda gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawagambiriti na Mtuwa Mlungu kajimira maluwa ga Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Ayubu pakawaluwiriti kala waganja wakuyi, Mtuwa Mlungu kamwuzilira Ayubu ntambu yakuyi ya kwanja. Kamwongeleriti mala mbili ya vyoseri vyakaweriti navi pa kwanja. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Shakapanu walongu wakuyi, wadada wakuyi na waganja yawammaniti pa kwanja wamgendera ukaya kwakuyi, waliya shiboga pamuhera na yomberi. Wamkola mawoku kwajili ya ntabiku yoseri yeni Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kamjegera. Kila yumu gwawu kampanana Ayubu mabuwi ga feza na peti ya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Muvinja vyavifuwata Mtuwa Mlungu kamtekelera nentu Ayubu kuliku ntambu yakaweriti kwanja, su Ayubu kawera na kondolu kumi na msheshi, ngamiya elufu sita ng'ombi elufu mbili na punda shidala elufu yimu. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Kaweriti viraa na wana wapalu saba na wadala watatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Mhinga gwakuyi gwa kwanza wamshemiti Yemima na gwa pili Keziya na gwa tatu Kereni Hapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Muisi yoseri ayi kuweritindiri na wanawadala waherepa handa wahinga wa Ayubu. Tati gwawu kawalekeriti uhala ntambu yakawalekeriti wakaka wawu.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Pa aga Ayubu kalikala vinja miya alubayini na yomberi kawawona wana wakuyi na wazukulu wakuyi mpaka shiyiwuku sha msheshi. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Shakapanu, Ayubu kahowa pakawera mzewi gwa vinja vivuwa nentu.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>